		["{npc:7955} sells the other colours (200g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "{npc:7955}出售其他颜色（无限客户端中每匹200金）。想要哪个就买哪个；如果喜欢已获得的坐骑，也可以不买。",
