		["Fly to {area:3317} if you have it; otherwise fly to {area:272} and walk east from {zone:1424} into the {zone:1425}."] = "如果有{area:3317}的飞行路线就飞过去；否则飞往{area:272}，从{zone:1424}向东步行进入{zone:1425}。",
