		["44 {item:7912} for {item:7945}: {skill:186}: {object:2040} (skill 175) in {zone:1425} (40-50), {zone:1444} (40-50) and {zone:1447} (45-55); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:2040} in {zone:1425} is marked."] = "为 {item:7945} 准备 44 个 {item:7912}：通过 {skill:186} 开采 {zone:1425}（40-50 级）、{zone:1444}（40-50 级）和 {zone:1447}（45-55 级）的 {object:2040}（需要技能 175），或在拍卖行购买。已标记 {zone:1425} 中 {object:2040} 最密集的位置。",
		["44 {item:7912} for {item:7945}: {skill:186}: {object:2040} (skill 175) in {zone:1443} (30-40), {zone:1425} (40-50) and {zone:1444} (40-50); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:2040} in {zone:1443} is marked."] = "准备 44 个 {item:7912}，用于 {item:7945}：通过 {skill:186} 开采 {object:2040}（技能 175），产地有 {zone:1443}（30-40 级）、{zone:1425}（40-50 级）和 {zone:1444}（40-50 级）；或在拍卖行购买。已标记 {zone:1443} 中 {object:2040} 最密集的区域。",
		["801 {item:12365} for {item:12643}, {item:12773} and {item:12775}: {skill:186}: {object:324} (skill 245) in {zone:1419} (45-55), {zone:1448} (48-55) and {zone:1452} (55-60); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:324} in {zone:1419} is marked."] = "为 {item:12643}、{item:12773} 和 {item:12775} 准备801块 {item:12365}：{skill:186}：开采 {zone:1419}（45—55级）、{zone:1448}（48—55级）和 {zone:1452}（55—60级）的 {object:324}（技能245）；或从拍卖行购买。已标记 {zone:1419} 中 {object:324} 最密集的区域。",
		["801 {item:12365} for {item:12643}, {item:12773} and {item:12775}: {skill:186}: {object:324} (skill 245) in {zone:1448} (48-55), {zone:1451} (55-60) and {zone:1452} (55-60); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:324} in {zone:1448} is marked."] = "准备801个{item:12365}制作{item:12643}、{item:12773}和{item:12775}：{skill:186}：在{zone:1448}（48-55级）、{zone:1451}（55-60级）和{zone:1452}（55-60级）采集{object:324}（技能245）；或从拍卖行购买。已标记{zone:1448}中{object:324}最密集的位置。",
		["Apprentice {skill:164} lets you craft up to 75 for 10c, at any character level. Any {skill:164} trainer of your faction teaches it; the arrow picks the nearest. Buy a {item:5956} (any blacksmithing supplier) and pair it with {skill:186}: {item:2835} and {item:2770} come from the Copper Veins of every starting zone. 1-75 takes about 1s of recipes, plus 286 {item:2835} to gather or buy."] = "初级{skill:164}的技能上限为75，学习费用10铜币，角色等级不限。向本阵营任意{skill:164}训练师学习即可；箭头指向最近的一位。购买{item:5956}（任意锻造供应商均有），并搭配{skill:186}：所有初始地区的铜矿都能产出{item:2835}和{item:2770}。1-75的配方费用约1银币，另需采集或购买286个{item:2835}。",
		["Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300 for 5g (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:164} 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:2836} ({zone:1434}); Horde {npc:2836} ({zone:1434}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:16640} (from 225), {spell:9968} (from 210), {spell:9920} (from 175), {spell:10001} (from 205) and {spell:16639} (from 225). 225-300 takes about 3g 60s of recipes, plus 44 {item:1210}, 596 {item:3860}, 142 {item:4304}, 19 {item:7909}, 19 {item:7910}, 44 {item:7912}, 11 {item:7971}, 206 {item:8170}, 2026 {item:12359}, 801 {item:12365} and 10 {item:12799} to gather or buy."] = "大师级技能将上限从225提高到300，费用5金币（经典旧世价格；数据中没有无限服的价格）；需要 {skill:164} 200和角色35级，因此达到200后，随时拜访都能学习。只有少数训练师教授：联盟的 {npc:2836}（{zone:1434}）；部落的 {npc:2836}（{zone:1434}）。箭头会选择本阵营最近的一位。现在学习：{spell:16640}（225起）、{spell:9968}（210起）、{spell:9920}（175起）、{spell:10001}（205起）和 {spell:16639}（225起）。225—300阶段约需购买3金币60银币的配方，另外还需采集或购买44颗 {item:1210}、596块 {item:3860}、142张 {item:4304}、19颗 {item:7909}、19颗 {item:7910}、44块 {item:7912}、11颗 {item:7971}、206张 {item:8170}、2026块 {item:12359}、801块 {item:12365} 和10颗 {item:12799}。",
		["Artisan {skill:164}"] = "专家级{skill:164}",
		["Back to a {skill:164} trainer: {spell:2672} (from 95, 5s)."] = "回去找 {skill:164} 训练师：学习 {spell:2672}（95点起可学，5银币）。",
		["Back to a {skill:164} trainer: {spell:2674} (from 100, 10s)."] = "返回 {skill:164} 训练师处：学习 {spell:2674}（技能 100 起，10 银币）。",
		["Back to a {skill:164} trainer: {spell:3320} (from 25, 1s). Also learn {spell:1230171} (1s): Forever's {skill:164} camp item, 1 {item:2835} and 1 {item:2840}, placed at a campsite beside a campfire for its buff. The Camping 101: {skill:164} quest from your starting area's camping guide (after The Great Outdoors) sends you to a blacksmithing trainer who teaches it free."] = "返回 {skill:164} 训练师处：学习 {spell:3320}（25起，1银币）。同时学习 {spell:1230171}（1银币）：这是无限服的 {skill:164} 露营物品，需1块 {item:2835} 和1块 {item:2840}，在营地营火旁放置可获得增益。起始地区露营指南中的“露营 101：{skill:164}”任务（在“广阔天地”之后）会派你去找锻造训练师，可免费学会它。",
		["Back to a {skill:164} trainer: {spell:7223} (from 160)."] = "回到{skill:164}训练师处：学习{spell:7223}（160起）。",
		["Back to a {skill:164} trainer: {spell:9918} (from 175)."] = "返回 {skill:164} 训练师处：学习 {spell:9918}（175起）。",
		["Back to a {skill:164} trainer: {spell:9959} (from 205)."] = "回去找 {skill:164} 训练师：学习 {spell:9959}（205点起可学）。",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 28 {item:2605} (28s); about 28s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} and {npc:5817}). If you smelt the 195 {item:3859} yourself ({skill:186} 165: an {item:3575} and a Coal each), buy 195 Coal too (9g 75s, trade and blacksmithing suppliers); skip them if you buy the bars."] = "一次买齐本阶段的用量：28份 {item:2605}（28银币）；总计约28银币。箭头会指向本阵营最近的商人（{zone:1453}：{npc:1347}、{npc:1286} 和 {npc:5565}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3364}、{npc:3367} 和 {npc:5817}）。如果自行熔炼195块 {item:3859}（{skill:186} 165：每块需一块 {item:3575} 和一份煤），还需购买195份煤（9金币75银币，商贸及锻造供应商有售）；如果直接买锭，就不用买煤。",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: {item:5956} (a tool: one, kept in your bags, 18c); about 18c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:5519}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5512}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3367}, {npc:5817} and Sovik)."] = "一次买齐整个阶段的用量：{item:5956}（工具：只需一个，留在背包里，18铜）；合计约18铜。箭头会选择本阵营最近的商人（{zone:1453}：{npc:5519}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5512}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3367}、{npc:5817}和索维克）。",
		["Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225 for 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:164} 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:4258} ({zone:1455}); Horde {npc:3355} ({zone:1454}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:3501} (from 140) and {spell:3337} (from 100, 10s). 150-225 takes about 10s of recipes and 28s of vendor goods, plus 234 {item:2838}, 168 {item:3575}, 195 {item:3859}, 320 {item:3860} and 30 {item:7912} to gather or buy."] = "高级技能将上限从150提高到225，费用50银币（经典旧世价格；数据中没有无限服的价格）；需要 {skill:164} 125和角色20级，因此达到125后，随时拜访都能学习。只有少数训练师教授：联盟的 {npc:4258}（{zone:1455}）；部落的 {npc:3355}（{zone:1454}）。箭头会选择本阵营最近的一位。现在学习：{spell:3501}（140起）和 {spell:3337}（100起，10银币）。150—225阶段约需购买10银币的配方和28银币的商人物资，另外还需采集或购买234块 {item:2838}、168块 {item:3575}、195块 {item:3859}、320块 {item:3860} 和30块 {item:7912}。",
		["Expert {skill:164}"] = "高级{skill:164}",
		["Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 5s; it needs {skill:164} 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every {skill:164} trainer teaches it: Alliance {npc:3136} ({zone:1431}), {npc:252479} ({zone:2521}), {npc:10276} ({zone:1455}) and {npc:5511} ({zone:1453}); Horde {npc:276067} ({zone:1420}), {npc:252479} ({zone:2521}), {npc:4596} ({zone:1458}), {npc:2998} ({zone:1456}), {npc:1383} ({zone:1454}) and {npc:3478} ({zone:1413}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:2666} (from 45, 2s) and {spell:3326} (from 50, 2s 50c). 75-150 takes about 19s 50c of recipes and 18c of vendor goods, plus 256 {item:2836}, 28 {item:2838}, 210 {item:2840} and 320 {item:2841} to gather or buy."] = "中级可将上限从75提高到150，费用5银；需要{skill:164}达到50且角色等级10，因此从50点起任何一次拜访都可以学。并非每个{skill:164}训练师都教授：联盟为{npc:3136}（{zone:1431}）、{npc:252479}（{zone:2521}）、{npc:10276}（{zone:1455}）和{npc:5511}（{zone:1453}）；部落为{npc:276067}（{zone:1420}）、{npc:252479}（{zone:2521}）、{npc:4596}（{zone:1458}）、{npc:2998}（{zone:1456}）、{npc:1383}（{zone:1454}）和{npc:3478}（{zone:1413}）。箭头会指向你所在阵营最近的一位。现在学习：{spell:2666}（45点起，2银）和{spell:3326}（50点起，2银50铜）。75-150约需19银50铜的配方和18铜的商人材料，另需自行收集或购买256个{item:2836}、28个{item:2838}、210个{item:2840}和320个{item:2841}。",
		["Journeyman {skill:164}"] = "中级{skill:164}",
		["Learn {skill:164}"] = "学习{skill:164}",
		["a tool, keep it in your bags"] = "工具，留在背包里",
		["from the recipe in your bags"] = "使用背包里的配方",
		["{item:12365} (Alliance)"] = "{item:12365}（联盟）",
		["{item:12365} (Horde)"] = "{item:12365}（部落）",
		["{item:12426} is orange at 285 (yellow 290, green 300, grey 310): about 19 crafts to 300. Each takes 34 {item:12359}, 1 {item:7910} and 1 {item:7909}. About 34 Thorium Bars a craft against the battleaxe's 40 and its grinding stones, orange to 290. Below character level 50 {npc:14567} has no quest for you: keep making Huge Thorium Battleaxes to 300 instead (yellow to 292, grey at 305: about twice the Thorium Bars). Needs an anvil nearby. {item:7909} (19 for 225-300): {item:7909} turns up in about one {object:2047} or {object:123309} in 500: buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find while mining. {item:7910} (19 for 225-300): {item:7910} turns up in about one {object:2047} or {object:123309} in 143: buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find while mining. {skill:164} 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{item:12426}在285时为橙色（290变黄，300变绿，310变灰）：约制作19次可升至300。每次需要34个{item:12359}、1个{item:7910}和1个{item:7909}。每次约用34块瑟银锭，而战斧要40块，还要砂轮；此配方到290前都是橙色。角色等级低于50时，{npc:14567}不会提供任务：改为继续制作巨型瑟银战斧至300（292前为黄色，305变灰：约需两倍瑟银锭）。附近需要有铁砧。{item:7909}（225-300阶段需要19个）：约五百个{object:2047}或{object:123309}出一个{item:7909}：去拍卖行买，或留着采矿时找到的。{item:7910}（225-300阶段需要19个）：约143个{object:2047}或{object:123309}出一个{item:7910}：去拍卖行买，或留着采矿时找到的。{skill:164}300是传承系统的里程碑。",
		["{item:12426} to 300"] = "制作{item:12426}，提升至 300",
		["{item:12643} is orange at 225 (yellow 230, green 232, grey 235): about 17 crafts to 235. Each takes 1 {item:12365}. One {item:12365} a craft (Thorium veins): cheap points at the start of Artisan."] = "{item:12643} 在技能 225 时为橙色（230 变黄、232 变绿、235 变灰）：约制作 17 次可升到 235。每次需要 1 个 {item:12365}。每次消耗一个来自瑟银矿脉的 {item:12365}：这是大师级初期较省钱的升级方式。",
		["{item:12643} to 235"] = "{item:12643}练到235",
		["{item:12773} is orange at 250 (yellow 275, green 287, grey 300): about 5 crafts to 255, a point every craft. Each takes 20 {item:12359}, 2 {item:12799}, 2 {item:12644} and 4 {item:8170}. Make the 10 {item:12644} first. {item:12799} turns up in about one Thorium vein in 130: buy the ten at the Auction House. Five crafts only, until the battleaxe plans can be used at 255. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:12359} (2026 for 225-300): {skill:186}: smelt {item:10620}; or the Auction House. {item:12799} (10 for 225-300): {item:12799} turns up in about one {object:175404}, {object:177388} or {object:180215} in 143: buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find while mining."] = "{item:12773} 在技能 250 时为橙色（275 变黄、287 变绿、300 变灰）：约制作 5 次可到 255，每次必涨一点。每次需要 20 个 {item:12359}、2 个 {item:12799}、2 个 {item:12644} 和 4 个 {item:8170}。先制作 10 个 {item:12644}。{item:12799} 大约每 130 处瑟银矿脉才出一个：去拍卖行买十个。只制作五次，到 255 后就能使用战斧设计图。附近需要铁砧。{item:12359}（225-300 阶段需 2026 个）：通过 {skill:186} 熔炼 {item:10620}，或在拍卖行购买。{item:12799}（225-300 阶段需 10 个）：{item:12799} 大约每 143 处 {object:175404}、{object:177388} 或 {object:180215} 才出一个；可在拍卖行购买，或留着采矿时找到的。",
		["{item:12773} to 255"] = "制作{item:12773}，提升至 255",
		["{item:12775} is orange at 255 (yellow 280, green 292, grey 305): about 31 crafts to 285. Each takes 40 {item:12359}, 6 {item:12644} and 6 {item:8170}. Make the 186 {item:12644} first. Plans from {npc:11278} ({area:2298}, {zone:1422}), unlimited stock, but they bind when picked up. Forty Thorium Bars and six Dense Grinding Stones a craft: the dearest stretch, so stop where the {quest:7654} take over. Other ways through: world-drop plans from the Auction House (the Radiant pieces: about 820 Thorium Bars and 190 Hearts of Fire for the Radiant route) or the Merchant's Favor sets. Needs an anvil nearby."] = "{item:12775} 在255点时为橙色（280变黄，292变绿，305变灰）：制作约31次可到285。每次需要40块 {item:12359}、6个 {item:12644} 和6张 {item:8170}。先制作好186个 {item:12644}。图纸由 {npc:11278}（{zone:1422} 的 {area:2298}）出售，不限量，但拾取后绑定。每次制作消耗四十块瑟银锭和六个致密砂轮：这是开销最大的阶段，所以到可以改做 {quest:7654} 时就停下。其他方案包括在拍卖行购买世界掉落图纸（辐光系列：这条路线约需820块瑟银锭和190个火焰之心），或采用商人青睐套装。附近需要有铁砧。",
		["{item:12775} to 285"] = "制作{item:12775}，提升至 285",
		["{item:12819} teaches {item:12773} ({skill:164} 250) for 1g 60s. Sold by {npc:11278} ({zone:1422})."] = "{item:12819} 可教你制作 {item:12773}（{skill:164} 250），售价1金币60银币。由 {npc:11278}（{zone:1422}）出售。",
		["{item:12823} teaches {item:12775} ({skill:164} 255) for 2g. Sold by {npc:11278} ({zone:1422})."] = "{item:12823} 可教会制作 {item:12775}（{skill:164} 255），售价 2 金币。由 {npc:11278}（{zone:1422}）出售。",
		["{item:2838} (Alliance)"] = "{item:2838}（联盟）",
		["{item:2838} (Horde)"] = "{item:2838}（部落）",
		["{item:4304} (Alliance)"] = "{item:4304}（联盟）",
		["{item:4304} (Horde)"] = "{item:4304}（部落）",
		["{item:6040} is yellow at 185 (yellow 185, green 197, grey 210): about 39 crafts to 205. Each takes 5 {item:3859} and 2 {spell:3337}. Make the 78 {spell:3337} first. Steel Bars are smelted from an {item:3575} and a Coal ({skill:186} 165; Coal from trade and blacksmithing suppliers), so each bracer is five of each. Each bracer takes two Heavy Grinding Stones: make them first. Specialisation (optional): at 200 and character level 40, {npc:5164} ({zone:1455}) or {npc:11177} ({zone:1454}) starts The Art of the {spell:9788}: 4 Ornate Mithril Helms, 2 {item:7936} and an {item:7935}, whose plans come from a Mithril Order quest chain. {npc:11146} ({zone:1455}) or {npc:11178} ({zone:1454}) starts The Way of the Weaponsmith: 4 Moonsteel Broadswords, 4 Massive Iron Axes, 2 Heavy Mithril Axes and 2 Big Black Maces; on Forever the {item:3853} plans ({npc:2482}, {area:35}) and {item:3855} plans bind when picked up, so buy and use them yourself. You can take only one; neither is needed for 300, and the beta never tested them (it stopped at level 30). Needs an anvil nearby. {item:3859} (195 for 150-225): {skill:186}: smelt {item:3575} and Coal; or the Auction House."] = "{item:6040}在技能185时为黄色（185变黄，197变绿，210变灰）：约制作39次可到205。每次需要5个{item:3859}和2个{spell:3337}。先制作78个{spell:3337}。钢锭由1个{item:3575}和1份煤块熔炼而成（需要{skill:186}165；煤块向杂货及锻造供应商购买），所以每副护腕需要铁锭和煤块各5份。每副护腕还需2个重砂轮：先做好。专精（可选）：技能200且角色40级时，{npc:5164}（{zone:1455}）或{npc:11177}（{zone:1454}）提供“铸造护甲的艺术”（{spell:9788}）：需要4个精制秘银头盔、2个{item:7936}和1个{item:7935}，图纸来自秘银会任务链。{npc:11146}（{zone:1455}）或{npc:11178}（{zone:1454}）提供“武器铸造师之道”：需要4把月钢宽剑、4把巨型铁斧、2把秘银重斧和2把巨型黑色锤；无限中，{item:3853}图纸（{area:35}的{npc:2482}出售）和{item:3855}图纸拾取绑定，必须自己购买并学习。两种专精只能选一种；升到300均不需要，而且测试版未测试过它们（测试止于30级）。附近需要有铁砧。{item:3859}（150-225共需195个）：通过{skill:186}熔炼{item:3575}和煤块，或在拍卖行购买。",
		["{item:6040} to 205"] = "制作{item:6040}，提升至 205",
		["{item:7912} (Alliance)"] = "{item:7912}（联盟）",
		["{item:7912} (Horde)"] = "{item:7912}（部落）",
		["{item:7930} is orange at 205 (yellow 225, green 235, grey 245): about 20 crafts to 225, a point every craft. Each takes 16 {item:3860}. Sixteen Mithril Bars a craft and nothing else; orange to 225 on Forever, so a point every craft to the Artisan cap. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:3860} (320 for 150-225): {skill:186}: smelt {item:3858}; or the Auction House. {skill:164} 225 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{item:7930} 在技能205时为橙色（225变黄，235变绿，245变灰）：大约制作20次升到225，每次必涨一点。每次需要16块 {item:3860}。每次只需十六块秘银锭，无需其他材料；在无限服中到225前保持橙色，因此直到大师级上限每次都必涨一点。附近需要有铁砧。{item:3860}（150—225共需320块）：{skill:186}：熔炼 {item:3858}；或从拍卖行购买。{skill:164} 225是传承系统的一项里程碑。",
		["{item:7930} to 225"] = "将{item:7930}做到 225",
		["{item:7933} is yellow at 235 (yellow 230, green 240, grey 250): about 30 crafts to 247. Each takes 14 {item:3860} and 4 {item:4304}. Mithril Bars from Mithril Deposits; {item:4304} from skinners or the Auction House. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:3860} (596 for 225-300): {skill:186}: smelt {item:3858}; or the Auction House."] = "{item:7933} 在技能235时为黄色（230变黄，240变绿，250变灰）：大约制作30次升到247。每次需要14块 {item:3860} 和4张 {item:4304}。秘银锭来自秘银矿脉；{item:4304} 从剥皮玩家或拍卖行获取。附近需要有铁砧。{item:3860}（225—300共需596块）：{skill:186}：熔炼 {item:3858}；或从拍卖行购买。",
		["{item:7933} to 247"] = "制作{item:7933}，提升至 247",
		["{item:7945} is green at 247 (yellow 230, green 242, grey 255): about 11 crafts to 250. Each takes 16 {item:3860}, 1 {item:7971}, 4 {item:1210}, 1 {item:7966} and 2 {item:4304}. Make the 11 {item:7966} first. Only about 11 crafts to bridge 247-250, but each wants four Shadowgems (about one {object:1732} in a hundred) and a {item:7971}: buy those at the Auction House unless your bags already hold them. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:1210} (44 for 225-300): {item:1210} turns up in about one {object:1731}, {object:1732} or {object:1733} in 100: buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find while mining. {item:7971} (11 for 225-300): {item:7971} is a rare drop (no mob gives it one time in 50): buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find."] = "{item:7945}在247时为绿色（230变黄，242变绿，255变灰）：约制作11次可升至250。每次需要16个{item:3860}、1个{item:7971}、4个{item:1210}、1个{item:7966}和2个{item:4304}。先制作11个{item:7966}。247-250只需制作约11次，但每次都要四颗暗影石（约一百个{object:1732}出一颗）和一个{item:7971}：除非背包已有，否则去拍卖行购买。附近需要有铁砧。{item:1210}（225-300阶段需要44个）：约一百个{object:1731}、{object:1732}或{object:1733}出一个{item:1210}：去拍卖行买，或留着采矿时找到的。{item:7971}（225-300阶段需要11个）：{item:7971}是稀有掉落（没有任何怪物的掉率能达到五十分之一）：去拍卖行买，或留着找到的。",
		["{item:7945} to 250"] = "制作{item:7945}，提升至 250",
		["{item:7964} is yellow at 175 (yellow 175, green 180, grey 185): about 30 crafts to 185. Each takes 1 {item:7912}. One {item:7912} a craft (Mithril Deposits): cheap points between the iron and the steel bracers. Use the stones on your weapons or sell them."] = "{item:7964} 在技能175时为黄色（175变黄，180变绿，185变灰）：大约制作30次升到185。每次需要1块 {item:7912}。每次用一块 {item:7912}（来自秘银矿脉）：在制作铁质护腕与钢质护腕之间，这是便宜的冲点方式。做好的石头可用于武器或出售。",
		["{item:7964} to 185"] = "{item:7964}练到185",
		["{item:8170} (Alliance)"] = "{item:8170}（联盟）",
		["{item:8170} (Horde)"] = "{item:8170}（部落）",
		["{npc:14567} ({zone:1446}) trades {item:12700} ({skill:164} 270) for 40 {item:12359} in {quest:7654}, which needs {skill:164} 265 and character level 50; take {quest:7652} first (it asks for nothing). The plans bind when picked up."] = "{npc:14567}（{zone:1446}）会通过 {quest:7654}，用 {item:12700}（{skill:164} 270）换取40块 {item:12359}，任务需要 {skill:164} 265和角色50级；先接 {quest:7652}（无需任何物品）。图纸拾取后绑定。",
		["{skill:164} 150-225: vendor goods"] = "{skill:164} 150–225：商人材料",
		["{skill:164} 75-150: vendor goods"] = "{skill:164} 75–150：商人材料",
		["{skill:164} recipes at 100"] = "100点的{skill:164}配方",
		["{skill:164} recipes at 113"] = "{skill:164}：技能 113 时学习的配方",
		["{skill:164} recipes at 175"] = "175点的{skill:164}配方",
		["{skill:164} recipes at 185"] = "185点的{skill:164}配方",
		["{skill:164} recipes at 205"] = "{skill:164}：技能 205 时学习的配方",
		["{skill:164} recipes at 35"] = "{skill:164}：技能 35 时学习的配方",
		["{spell:2660} is orange at 1 (yellow 15, green 35, grey 55): about 42 crafts to 35. Each takes 1 {item:2835}. One {item:2835} a craft, a point every craft to 15."] = "{spell:2660}在1时为橙色（15变黄，35变绿，55变灰）：约制作42次可升至35。每次需要1个{item:2835}。每次制作消耗一个{item:2835}，15以前每次都升一点。",
		["{spell:2660} to 35"] = "制作{spell:2660}，提升至 35",
		["{spell:2666} is orange at 83 (yellow 85, green 105, grey 125): about 21 crafts to 100. Each takes 10 {item:2840}. Forever teaches {spell:2666} from 45; it stays orange to 85. Ten Copper Bars a craft: smelt your {item:2770}. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:5956} is a tool: keep it in your bags. {item:2840} (210 for 75-150): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2770}; or the Auction House."] = "{spell:2666} 在83点时为橙色（85变黄，105变绿，125变灰）：制作约21次可到100。每次需要10块 {item:2840}。无限服在45点即可学习 {spell:2666}；到85点前一直为橙色。每次制作消耗十块铜锭：熔炼你的 {item:2770}。附近需要有铁砧。{item:5956} 是工具：留在背包中。{item:2840}（75—150阶段需要210块）：{skill:186}：熔炼 {item:2770}；也可在拍卖行购买。",
		["{spell:2666} to 100"] = "{spell:2666}练到100",
		["{spell:2672} is orange at 113 (yellow 125, green 140, grey 155): about 64 crafts to 150. Each takes 5 {item:2841} and 2 {spell:3326}. Make the 128 {spell:3326} first. Each bracer takes two Coarse Grinding Stones ({item:2836} from Tin Veins): make them first; they give points too. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:2841} (320 for 75-150): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2840} and {item:3576}; or the Auction House. {skill:164} 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:2672}在113时为橙色（125变黄，140变绿，155变灰）：约制作64次可升至150。每次需要5个{item:2841}和2个{spell:3326}。先制作128个{spell:3326}。每副护腕需要两个粗制砂轮（{item:2836}来自锡矿）：先做好砂轮，它们也能提升技能。附近需要有铁砧。{item:2841}（75-150阶段需要320个）：{skill:186}：用{item:2840}和{item:3576}熔炼；或从拍卖行购买。{skill:164}150是传承系统的里程碑。",
		["{spell:2672} to 150"] = "{spell:2672}练到150",
		["{spell:2674} is yellow at 100 (yellow 100, green 107, grey 115): about 28 crafts to 113. Each takes 1 {item:2838}. {item:2838} comes from Iron Deposits; one a craft."] = "{spell:2674} 在技能 100 时为黄色（100 变黄、107 变绿、115 变灰）：约制作 28 次可升到 113。每次需要 1 个 {item:2838}。{item:2838} 来自铁矿石，每次制作消耗一个。",
		["{spell:2674} to 113"] = "制作{spell:2674}，提升至 113",
		["{spell:3320} is green at 75 (yellow 45, green 65, grey 85): about 58 crafts to 83. Each takes 2 {item:2835}. Two {item:2835} a craft. Grinding stones are parts for later plans; the extras sell to vendors."] = "{spell:3320} 在技能75时为绿色（45变黄，65变绿，85变灰）：大约制作58次升到83。每次需要2块 {item:2835}。每次用两块 {item:2835}。砂轮是后续图纸的材料；多余的可卖给商人。",
		["{spell:3320} is orange at 35 (yellow 45, green 65, grey 85): about 64 crafts to 75. Each takes 2 {item:2835}. Two {item:2835} a craft. Grinding stones are parts for later plans; the extras sell to vendors."] = "{spell:3320}在35时为橙色（45变黄，65变绿，85变灰）：约制作64次可升至75。每次需要2个{item:2835}。每次制作消耗两个{item:2835}。砂轮是后续配方的材料；多余的可以卖给商人。",
		["{spell:3320} to 75"] = "{spell:3320}练到75",
		["{spell:3320} to 83"] = "{spell:3320}练到83",
		["{spell:3501} is orange at 150 (yellow 165, green 177, grey 190): about 28 crafts to 175. Each takes 6 {item:3575} and 1 {item:2605}. Six Iron Bars and a {item:2605} a craft; {item:2605} comes from tailoring, leatherworking and trade supplies vendors. Orange to 165 on Forever, so a point every craft for the first fifteen. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:3575} (168 for 150-225): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2772}; or the Auction House."] = "{spell:3501}在技能150时为橙色（165变黄，177变绿，190变灰）：约制作28次可到175。每次需要6个{item:3575}和1个{item:2605}。也就是每次6块铁锭和1个{item:2605}；{item:2605}可向裁缝、制皮及杂货供应商购买。无限中到165前都是橙色，因此前15次制作每次都涨一点。附近需要有铁砧。{item:3575}（150-225共需168个）：通过{skill:186}熔炼{item:2772}，或在拍卖行购买。",
		["{spell:3501} to 175"] = "将{spell:3501}做到 175",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/professions/cooking"] = (function() return {
		["Any {skill:185} trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice {skill:185} (any character level, 1s); the arrow picks the nearest. Forever: every cook knows {object:29784}. Craft a {item:279981} from one {item:4470} (38c) with {item:4471} (1s 35c, kept in your bags), then place the kit to light a cooking fire anywhere; make a few in advance (one use every 5 minutes). The first kits also raise {skill:185} to about 5. The Camping 101: {skill:185} quest at your starting area's camp sends you to this trainer."] = "本阵营任意{skill:185}训练师都能教授初级{skill:185}（无角色等级要求，1银币）；箭头指向最近的一位。无限：每位厨师都掌握{object:29784}。用1个{item:4470}（38铜币）配合{item:4471}（1银35铜，保留在背包中）制作{item:279981}，再放置套件，即可随地点起烹饪用火；提前做几个备用（每5分钟可使用一次）。最初制作的几个套件还能将{skill:185}提高到约5点。初始地区营地的“露营基础：{skill:185}”任务会让你来找这位训练师。",
		["Artisan {skill:185}"] = "专家级{skill:185}",
		["Artisan {skill:185} comes from {npc:8125} in {area:976} ({zone:1446}). The cooking trainer in {zone:1454} sends you; it needs skill 225 and level 35."] = "专家级{skill:185}由{area:976}（{zone:1446}）的{npc:8125}教授。{zone:1454}的烹饪训练师会指引你前往；需要技能225和等级35级。",
		["Artisan {skill:185} comes from {npc:8125} in {area:976} ({zone:1446}). The cooking trainer in {zone:1455} sends you; it needs skill 225 and level 35."] = "专家级{skill:185}由{area:976}（{zone:1446}）的{npc:8125}教授。{zone:1455}的烹饪训练师会指引你前往；需要技能225和等级35级。",
		["Buy and read {item:16072} (Expert {skill:185})"] = "购买并阅读{item:16072}（高级{skill:185}）",
		["Expert {skill:185}"] = "高级{skill:185}",
		["Expert {skill:185} raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and character level 20: it is a book, {item:16072} (1g); the arrow picks its nearest seller for your faction. Buy it and read it."] = "高级{skill:185}将上限提高到225；需要技能125、角色20级：通过书籍{item:16072}学习（1金币）；箭头会选择本阵营最近的售书商。买来阅读。",
		["Giant Eggs"] = "巨蛋",
		["Innkeepers and food vendors sell {item:8932}; the arrow picks the nearest."] = "旅店老板和食物商人出售 {item:8932}；箭头会选择最近的一位。",
		["Journeyman {skill:185}"] = "中级{skill:185}",
		["Journeyman {skill:185} raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and no character level: the arrow picks the nearest {skill:185} trainer of your faction; training costs 5s."] = "中级{skill:185}将上限提高到150；需要技能50，没有角色等级要求：箭头会指向你所在阵营最近的{skill:185}训练师；训练花费5银。",
		["Learn {skill:185}"] = "学习{skill:185}",
		["Prowler (86%) in {zone:1429}, or wherever the arrow points"] = "觅食的灰狼（86%），在{zone:1429}，或前往箭头指向的地点",
		["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item."] = "箭头会为每种物品指向本阵营最近的商人。",
		["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item. You need 240 {item:3713} (3g 84s)."] = "箭头会为每件物品选择本阵营最近的商人。需要 240 个 {item:3713}（3 金 84 银）。",
		["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item. You need 30 {item:2692} (12s)."] = "箭头会为每种物品选择离你最近的本阵营商人。你需要 30 个 {item:2692}（12 银）。",
		["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item. You need 40 {item:159} (2s)."] = "箭头会为每件物品选择本阵营最近的商人。你需要40个{item:159}（2银）。",
		["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item. You need 44 {item:2678} (90c)."] = "箭头会为每种物品选择距离最近的本阵营商人。需要44份 {item:2678}（90铜币）。",
		["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item. You need 45 {item:2692} (18s)."] = "箭头会为每件物品选择本阵营最近的商人。需要 45 个 {item:2692}（18 银币）。",
		["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item. You need 46 {item:2692} (18s 40c)."] = "箭头会为每种物品选择距离最近的本阵营商人。需要46份 {item:2692}（18银币40铜币）。",
		["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item. You need 50 {item:2678} (1s)."] = "箭头会为每种物品选取本阵营最近的商人。你需要50个{item:2678}（1银币）。",
		["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item. You need 52 {item:2678} (1s 10c)."] = "箭头会为每件物品选择本阵营最近的商人。你需要52个{item:2678}（1银10铜）。",
		["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item. You need 52 {item:2692} (20s 80c)."] = "箭头会为每种物品选择离你最近的本阵营商人。你需要 52 个 {item:2692}（20 银 80 铜）。",
		["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item. You need 52 {item:4536} (2s 75c)."] = "箭头会为每种物品选择距离最近的本阵营商人。需要52个 {item:4536}（2银币75铜币）。",
		["{item:12210} is orange from 175 (yellow at 215, green at 235, grey at 255): about 52 crafts to 225. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}. {item:12228} costs 50s at its vendor; the arrow picks the nearest one of your faction. {zone:1417}: {npc:2810} at {area:320} (Alliance) and {npc:2821} at {area:321} (Horde) sell the recipe and {item:2692} beside the raptors. {item:17222} (any trainer from 200, 40s) is the alternative, but it takes two {item:12205} a craft and Dustwallow's spiders drop one about two kills in five."] = "{item:12210}从技能175起为橙色（215变黄，235变绿，255变灰）：约制作52次可到225。可在任意火源旁烹饪：城镇炉火或自己的{object:29784}都行。{item:12228}在对应商人处售价50银币；箭头指向本阵营最近的一位。{zone:1417}：{area:320}的{npc:2810}（联盟）和{area:321}的{npc:2821}（部落）在迅猛龙活动区旁出售食谱及{item:2692}。也可选{item:17222}（任意训练师在技能200起可教，40银币），但每次需2个{item:12205}，尘泥沼泽蜘蛛约每击杀5只掉2次。",
		["{item:12210}: ingredients"] = "{item:12210}：材料",
		["{item:12210}: shopping"] = "{item:12210}：购物",
		["{item:12218} is orange from 225 (yellow at 265, green at 285, grey at 305): about 120 crafts to 300. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}. {item:16110} costs 1g 20s at its vendor; the arrow picks the nearest one of your faction. {item:12218} is orange to 265 and green from 285, yet it still carries you to 300. Fishers can finish on {item:13931} ({npc:8137}, {area:977}; yellow to 310) instead; {item:13932} needs an {item:279982} on Forever."] = "{item:12218}从技能225起为橙色（265变黄，285变绿，305变灰）：约制作120次可到300。可在任意火源旁烹饪：城镇炉火或自己的{object:29784}都行。{item:16110}在对应商人处售价1金20银；箭头指向本阵营最近的一位。{item:12218}到265前为橙色，285起为绿色，但仍可用它升到300。钓鱼玩家也可最后改做{item:13931}（{area:977}的{npc:8137}出售；到310前为黄色）；无限中，{item:13932}需要{item:279982}。",
		["{item:12218}: ingredients"] = "{item:12218}：材料",
		["{item:12218}: shopping"] = "{item:12218}：购物",
		["{item:5477} is orange from 50 (yellow at 90, green at 110, grey at 130): about 52 crafts to 100. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}. {item:5486} costs 4s 40c at its vendor; the arrow picks the nearest one of your faction."] = "{item:5477} 从50点起为橙色（90变黄，110变绿，130变灰）：制作约52次可到100。任意火源旁都能烹饪：城镇炉火或自己放置的 {object:29784} 均可。{item:5486} 在对应商人处售价4银币40铜币；箭头会选择最近的本阵营商人。",
		["{item:5477}: ingredients"] = "{item:5477}：材料",
		["{item:5477}: shopping"] = "{item:5477}：购物",
		["{item:5479} is orange from 100 (yellow at 140, green at 160, grey at 180): about 30 crafts to 130. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}. {item:5488} costs 4s at its vendor; the arrow picks the nearest one of your faction. {npc:3489}, the butcher beside this vendor at the Crossroads, sells {item:3735} (18s), the recipe after Expert: buy it now."] = "{item:5479}从100起为橙色（140变黄、160变绿、180变灰），做约30次可到130。任意火源都能烹饪，包括城镇壁炉或自己的{object:29784}。{item:5488}在商人处售价4银币，箭头会指向离你最近的本阵营商人。十字路口这位商人旁边的屠夫{npc:3489}出售{item:3735}（18银币），这是学会高级烹饪后要用的食谱，现在就买。",
		["{item:5479}: ingredients"] = "{item:5479}：材料",
		["{item:5479}: shopping"] = "{item:5479}：购物",
		["{item:5525} is orange from 50 (yellow at 90, green at 110, grey at 130): about 40 crafts to 90. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}. Any {skill:185} trainer teaches it from skill 50 for 1s. The same coastal crawlers drop {item:2674} for {spell:2544} next: keep it."] = "{item:5525} 从技能 50 起为橙色（90 变黄、110 变绿、130 变灰）：约制作 40 次可升到 90。在任意火源旁烹饪即可：城镇炉火或自己的 {object:29784}。技能达到 50 后，任意 {skill:185} 训练师都可教授，费用为 1 银。同一批海岸螃蟹还会掉落下一个配方 {spell:2544} 所需的 {item:2674}：留着。",
		["{item:5525}: ingredients"] = "{item:5525}：材料",
		["{item:5525}: shopping"] = "{item:5525}：购物",
		["{item:6888} is orange from 1 (yellow at 45, green at 65, grey at 85): about 50 crafts to 50. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}. {item:6888} comes with {skill:185} (the client teaches it with the skill); {item:2678} are a cooking vendor's. The Strigid owls of {zone:1438} drop a {item:6889} more often than not, and {zone:1439}'s moonkin drop them too. Fishers can cook {item:6290} (recipe 40c) from Rut'theran's waters instead, and {npc:6286} in {area:186} gives Recipe of the Kaldorei (seven Small Spider Legs from the Webwood spiders) for {item:5472}, orange from 10 to 50."] = "{item:6888}从技能1起为橙色（45变黄，65变绿，85变灰）：约制作50次可到50。可在任意火源旁烹饪：城镇炉火或自己的{object:29784}都行。{item:6888}随{skill:185}一同掌握（客户端在学习技能时教授）；{item:2678}向烹饪商人购买。{zone:1438}的巨翼枭掉落{item:6889}的概率超过一半，{zone:1439}的枭兽也会掉落。钓鱼玩家也可改用鲁瑟兰水域钓到的鱼制作{item:6290}（食谱40铜币）；{area:186}的{npc:6286}提供“卡多雷的菜谱”（需从树林蜘蛛收集7条小蜘蛛腿），奖励{item:5472}，该配方在10-50为橙色。",
		["{item:6888}: ingredients"] = "{item:6888}：材料",
		["{item:6888}: shopping"] = "{item:6888}：购物",
		["{item:6890} is orange from 50 (yellow at 80, green at 100, grey at 120): about 30 crafts to 80. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}. {item:6892} costs 2s 50c at its vendor; the arrow picks the nearest one of your faction. Black bears roam the hills of {zone:1432}."] = "{item:6890} 从50点起为橙色（80变黄，100变绿，120变灰）：制作约30次可到80。任意火源旁都能烹饪：城镇炉火或自己放置的 {object:29784} 均可。{item:6892} 在对应商人处售价2银币50铜币；箭头会选择最近的本阵营商人。黑熊在 {zone:1432} 的山丘中游荡。",
		["{item:6890}: ingredients"] = "{item:6890}：材料",
		["{item:6890}: shopping"] = "{item:6890}：购物",
		["{item:7974} comes from Big-mouth Clams: open each one, every clam holds one. The Muckshell crabs on the {zone:1445} coast south-west of Theramore drop a clam about seven kills in ten, so ten clams take about fifteen kills, on your way to {zone:1446}. The Steeljaw Snappers on {zone:1446}'s east coast drop them about one kill in three."] = "{item:7974} 来自巨型蚌壳：逐个打开，每个里面都有一个。{zone:1445} 海岸、塞拉摩西南的泥壳蟹约每十次击杀有七次掉落蚌壳，所以在前往 {zone:1446} 的途中，杀约十五只就能获得十个蚌壳。{zone:1446} 东海岸的钢腭钳嘴龟掉率约为三分之一。",
		["{npc:1018} (72%), {npc:1019} (67%) in {zone:1437}, or wherever the arrow points"] = "{npc:1018}（72%）、{npc:1019}（67%），在{zone:1437}，或前往箭头指向的地点",
		["{npc:1126} (36%), {npc:1125} (34%) in {zone:1426}, or wherever the arrow points"] = "{zone:1426} 的 {npc:1126}（36%）、{npc:1125}（34%），或箭头指向的其他地点",
		["{npc:1189} (39%) in {zone:1432}, or wherever the arrow points"] = "{zone:1432} 的 {npc:1189}（39%），或箭头指向的地点。",
