		["62 {item:7912} for {item:10505}: {skill:186}: {object:2040} (skill 175) in {zone:1434} (30-45), {zone:1425} (40-50) and {zone:1444} (40-50); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:2040} in {zone:1434} is marked."] = "为 {item:10505} 准备62个 {item:7912}：{skill:186}：在 {zone:1434}（30—45级）、{zone:1425}（40—50级）和 {zone:1444}（40—50级）开采 {object:2040}（技能175）；也可在拍卖行购买。已标出 {zone:1434} 中 {object:2040} 最密集的矿点群。",
		["62 {item:7912} for {item:10505}: {skill:186}: {object:2040} (skill 175) in {zone:1443} (30-40), {zone:1425} (40-50) and {zone:1444} (40-50); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:2040} in {zone:1443} is marked."] = "为 {item:10505} 准备62块 {item:7912}：{skill:186}：开采 {zone:1443}（30—40级）、{zone:1425}（40—50级）和 {zone:1444}（40—50级）的 {object:2040}（技能175）；或从拍卖行购买。已标记 {zone:1443} 中 {object:2040} 最密集的区域。",
		["74 {item:2838} for {spell:3967}: {skill:186}: {object:1735} (skill 125) in {zone:1417} (30-40), {zone:1434} (30-45) and {zone:1443} (30-40); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1735} in {zone:1417} is marked."] = "为 {spell:3967} 准备 74 个 {item:2838}：通过 {skill:186} 开采 {zone:1417}（30-40 级）、{zone:1434}（30-45 级）和 {zone:1443}（30-40 级）的 {object:1735}（需要技能 125），或在拍卖行购买。已标记 {zone:1417} 中 {object:1735} 最密集的位置。",
		["74 {item:2838} for {spell:3967}: {skill:186}: {object:1735} (skill 125) in {zone:1441} (25-35), {zone:1417} (30-40) and {zone:1434} (30-45); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1735} in {zone:1441} is marked."] = "准备 74 个 {item:2838}，用于 {spell:3967}：通过 {skill:186} 开采 {object:1735}（技能 125），产地有 {zone:1441}（25-35 级）、{zone:1417}（30-40 级）和 {zone:1434}（30-45 级）；或在拍卖行购买。已标记 {zone:1441} 中 {object:1735} 最密集的区域。",
		["Apprentice {skill:202} lets you craft up to 75 for 10c, at any character level. Any {skill:202} trainer of your faction teaches it; the arrow picks the nearest. Buy a {item:5956} and pair it with {skill:186}: {item:2835} and {item:2770} are the first parts. 1-75 takes about 4s 15c of recipes and 18s 18c of vendor goods, plus 46 {item:2835} and 75 {item:2840} to gather or buy."] = "初级 {skill:202} 将制作技能上限提高到75，费用10铜币，无角色等级要求。本阵营任何 {skill:202} 训练师都能教授；箭头会选择最近的一位。购买一把 {item:5956}，并搭配 {skill:186}：最先需要的材料是 {item:2835} 和 {item:2770}。1—75阶段约需购买4银15铜的配方和18银18铜的商人物资，另外还需采集或购买46块 {item:2835} 和75块 {item:2840}。",
		["Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300 for 4g 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:202} 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:8736} ({zone:1446}); Horde {npc:8736} ({zone:1446}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. 225-300 takes about 2g 80s of recipes, plus 118 {item:3860}, 212 {item:7912}, 156 {item:12359} and 24 {item:14047} to gather or buy."] = "大师级技能将上限从225提高到300，费用4金币50银币（经典旧世价格；数据中没有无限服的价格）；需要 {skill:202} 200和角色35级，因此达到200后，随时拜访都能学习。只有少数训练师教授：联盟的 {npc:8736}（{zone:1446}）；部落的 {npc:8736}（{zone:1446}）。箭头会选择本阵营最近的一位。225—300阶段约需购买2金币80银币的配方，另外还需采集或购买118块 {item:3860}、212块 {item:7912}、156块 {item:12359} 和24块 {item:14047}。",
		["Artisan {skill:202}"] = "专家级{skill:202}",
		["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:12585} (from 175)."] = "返回{skill:202}训练师处，学习{spell:12585}（技能 175 起可学）。",
		["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:12596} (from 210)."] = "返回{skill:202}训练师处，学习{spell:12596}（技能 210 起可学）。",
		["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:12621} (from 245)."] = "返回{skill:202}训练师处，学习{spell:12621}（技能 245 起可学）。",
		["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:3922} (from 30, 1s 15c). Also learn {spell:1230656} (1s): Forever's {skill:202} camp item, placed at a campsite beside a campfire. It takes a {spell:3922} and a {spell:3924}, which you learn at 30 and 50, so it gives no points. The Camping 101: {skill:202} quest from your starting area's camping guide (after The Great Outdoors) sends you to an engineering trainer who teaches it free."] = "返回 {skill:202} 训练师处：学习 {spell:3922}（技能 30 起可学，1 银 15 铜）。同时学习 {spell:1230656}（1 银）：这是无限的 {skill:202} 露营物品，可放在营地的营火旁。它需要一个 {spell:3922} 和一个 {spell:3924}，两者分别在技能 30 和 50 时学习，因此制作它不会提升技能。起始地区的露营向导在“广阔天地”之后提供的露营 101: {skill:202} 任务，会让你去找一名工程学训练师，由其免费教授。",
		["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:3945} (from 125)."] = "返回{skill:202}训练师处，学习{spell:3945}（技能 125 起可学）。",
		["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:3967} (from 190)."] = "返回{skill:202}训练师处，学习{spell:3967}（技能 190 起可学）。",
		["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:3973} (from 90) and {spell:3950} (from 140)."] = "回到{skill:202}训练师处：学习{spell:3973}（90起）和{spell:3950}（140起）。",
		["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:7430} (from 50, 1s 50c) and {spell:3924} (from 50, 1s 50c)."] = "返回 {skill:202} 训练师处：学习 {spell:7430}（技能 50 起可学，1 银 50 铜）和 {spell:3924}（技能 50 起可学，1 银 50 铜）。",
		["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:8334} (from 100)."] = "返回{skill:202}训练师处，学习{spell:8334}（技能 100 起可学）。",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 18 {item:2880} (18s) and {item:5956} (a tool: one, kept in your bags, 18c); about 18s 18c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:5519}, {npc:5514} and {npc:1286}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3367}, Gorina and {npc:5817})."] = "一次买齐这个技能阶段所需的物资：18 个 {item:2880}（18 银币）和 {item:5956}（工具：只要一个，放在背包里保留，18 铜币）；总计约 18 银 18 铜。箭头会选择本阵营最近的商人（{zone:1453}：{npc:5519}、{npc:5514} 和 {npc:1286}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3367}、高里纳和 {npc:5817}）。",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 31 {item:6530} (31s); about 31s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:5494} and {npc:1286}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3367}, {npc:3333} and {npc:5817})."] = "一次买齐整个阶段的用量：31个{item:6530}（31银）；合计约31银。箭头会选择本阵营最近的商人（{zone:1453}：{npc:5494}和{npc:1286}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3367}、{npc:3333}和{npc:5817}）。",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 45 {item:2880} (45s); about 45s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:5519}, {npc:5514} and {npc:1286}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3367}, Gorina and {npc:5817})."] = "一次买齐整个阶段的用量：45个{item:2880}（45银）；合计约45银。箭头会选择本阵营最近的商人（{zone:1453}：{npc:5519}、{npc:5514}和{npc:1286}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3367}、高里纳和{npc:5817}）。",
		["Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225 for 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:202} 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:5174} ({zone:1455}); Horde {npc:11017} ({zone:1454}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:9271} (from 150) and {spell:3953} (from 145). 150-225 takes about 31s of vendor goods, plus 19 {item:2319}, 19 {item:2592}, 31 {item:2836}, 74 {item:2838}, 100 {item:2841}, 6 {item:2842}, 81 {item:3575}, 19 {item:3860} and 62 {item:7912} to gather or buy."] = "高级将技能上限从 150 提高到 225，费用为 50 银币（经典旧世价格；数据中没有无限服的价格）；需要 {skill:202} 125 和角色等级 20，因此达到 125 后，任意一次来访都可学习。只有少数训练师教授：联盟为 {npc:5174}（{zone:1455}）；部落为 {npc:11017}（{zone:1454}）。箭头会指向你所属阵营最近的一位。现在学习：{spell:9271}（技能 150 起）和 {spell:3953}（技能 145 起）。150-225 阶段约需 31 银币的商人材料，另需采集或购买 19 个 {item:2319}、19 个 {item:2592}、31 个 {item:2836}、74 个 {item:2838}、100 个 {item:2841}、6 个 {item:2842}、81 个 {item:3575}、19 个 {item:3860} 和 62 个 {item:7912}。",
		["Expert {skill:202}"] = "高级{skill:202}",
		["Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 5s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:202} 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every {skill:202} trainer teaches it: Alliance {npc:1676} ({zone:1431}), {npc:5518} ({zone:1453}) and {npc:11029} ({zone:1455}); Horde {npc:11031} ({zone:1458}) and {npc:3412} ({zone:1454}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:3929} (from 75, 2s 50c) and {spell:3930} (from 75, 2s 50c). 75-150 takes about 5s of recipes and 45s of vendor goods, plus 15 {item:2836}, 27 {item:2838}, 72 {item:2840}, 61 {item:2841} and 2 {item:2842} to gather or buy."] = "中级将技能上限从 75 提高到 150，费用为 5 银币（经典旧世价格；数据中没有无限服的价格）；需要 {skill:202} 50 和角色等级 10，因此达到 50 后，任意一次来访都可学习。并非所有 {skill:202} 训练师都教授：联盟为 {npc:1676}（{zone:1431}）、{npc:5518}（{zone:1453}）和 {npc:11029}（{zone:1455}）；部落为 {npc:11031}（{zone:1458}）和 {npc:3412}（{zone:1454}）。箭头会指向你所属阵营最近的一位。现在学习：{spell:3929}（技能 75 起，2 银币 50 铜币）和 {spell:3930}（技能 75 起，2 银币 50 铜币）。75-150 阶段约需 5 银币的配方和 45 银币的商人材料，另需采集或购买 15 个 {item:2836}、27 个 {item:2838}、72 个 {item:2840}、61 个 {item:2841} 和 2 个 {item:2842}。",
		["Journeyman {skill:202}"] = "中级{skill:202}",
		["Learn {skill:202}"] = "学习{skill:202}",
		["a tool, keep it in your bags"] = "工具，留在背包里",
		["a tool: keep it in your bags"] = "工具：放在背包里",
		["from the recipe in your bags"] = "使用背包里的配方",
		["{item:10505} is yellow at 175 (yellow 175, green 185, grey 195): about 31 crafts to 191. Each takes 2 {item:7912}. Two {item:7912} a craft (Mithril Deposits). Make plenty: the triggers, slugs and Gyro-Shot all use it."] = "{item:10505} 在技能175时为黄色（175变黄，185变绿，195变灰）：大约制作31次升到191。每次需要2块 {item:7912}。每次用两块 {item:7912}（来自秘银矿脉）。多做一些：扳机、弹头和 秘银螺旋弹 都要用到。",
		["{item:10505} to 191"] = "制作{item:10505}，提升至 191",
		["{item:10512} is yellow at 210 (yellow 210, green 230, grey 250): about 19 crafts to 225. Each takes 1 {item:3860} and 1 {item:10505} and makes 200. Use the 19 {item:10505} you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. One {item:3860} and one {item:10505} a craft; hunters buy the slugs. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:3860} (19 for 150-225): {skill:186}: smelt {item:3858}; or the Auction House. {skill:202} 225 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{item:10512} 在210点时为黄色（210变黄，230变绿，250变灰）：制作约19次可到225。每次需要1块 {item:3860} 和1份 {item:10505}，产出200发。使用之前做好的19份 {item:10505}；上面的数量未包含它们。每次制作消耗一块 {item:3860} 和一份 {item:10505}；猎人会购买这些弹头。附近需要有铁砧。{item:3860}（150—225阶段需要19块）：{skill:186}：熔炼 {item:3858}；也可在拍卖行购买。{skill:202} 达到225是传承系统的一个里程碑。",
		["{item:10512} is yellow at 225 (yellow 210, green 230, grey 250): about 62 crafts to 245. Each takes 1 {item:3860} and 1 {item:10505} and makes 200. Make the 50 {item:10505} first. Use the 12 {item:10505} you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. One {item:3860} and one {item:10505} a craft; hunters buy the slugs. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:3860} (118 for 225-300): {skill:186}: smelt {item:3858}; or the Auction House."] = "{item:10512} 在225点时为黄色（210变黄，230变绿，250变灰）：制作约62次可到245。每次需要1块 {item:3860} 和1份 {item:10505}，产出200发。先制作50份 {item:10505}。使用之前做好的12份 {item:10505}；上面的数量未包含它们。每次制作消耗一块 {item:3860} 和一份 {item:10505}；猎人会购买这些弹头。附近需要有铁砧。{item:3860}（225—300阶段需要118块）：{skill:186}：熔炼 {item:3858}；也可在拍卖行购买。",
		["{item:10512} to 225"] = "将{item:10512}做到 225",
		["{item:10512} to 245"] = "将{item:10512}做到 245",
		["{item:10513} is yellow at 245 (yellow 245, green 265, grey 285): about 28 crafts to 265. Each takes 2 {item:3860} and 2 {item:10505} and makes 200. Make the 56 {item:10505} first. Two Mithril Bars and two {item:10505} a craft. Needs an anvil nearby."] = "{item:10513} 在技能 245 时为黄色（245 变黄、265 变绿、285 变灰）：约制作 28 次可到 265。每次需要 2 个 {item:3860} 和 2 个 {item:10505}，产出 200 个。先制作 56 个 {item:10505}。即每次两块秘银锭和两个 {item:10505}。附近需要铁砧。",
		["{item:10513} to 265"] = "制作{item:10513}，提升至 265",
		["{item:15994} is orange at 265 (yellow 280, green 290, grey 300): about 24 crafts to 287. Each takes 3 {item:12359} and 1 {item:14047}. Three Thorium Bars and a {item:14047} a craft; the widgets are parts for the later Thorium gadgets. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:12359} (156 for 225-300): {skill:186}: smelt {item:10620}; or the Auction House."] = "{item:15994} 在技能 265 时为橙色（280 变黄、290 变绿、300 变灰）：约制作 24 次可升到 287。每次需要 3 个 {item:12359} 和 1 个 {item:14047}，即三块瑟银锭和一个 {item:14047}；这些零件用于后续的瑟银装置。附近需要有铁砧。{item:12359}（225-300 阶段需 156 个）：通过 {skill:186} 熔炼 {item:10620}，或在拍卖行购买。",
		["{item:15994} to 287"] = "制作{item:15994}，提升至 287",
		["{item:16000} is orange at 287 (yellow 295, green 305, grey 315): about 14 crafts to 300. Each takes 6 {item:12359}. The schematic binds when picked up; six Thorium Bars a craft. Needs an anvil nearby. {skill:202} 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{item:16000} 在技能 287 时为橙色（295 变黄、305 变绿、315 变灰）：约制作 14 次可升到 300。每次需要 6 个 {item:12359}。结构图拾取后绑定；每次制作消耗六块瑟银锭。附近需要有铁砧。{skill:202} 达到 300 是传承系统的一个里程碑。",
		["{item:16000} to 300"] = "将{item:16000}做到 300",
		["{item:16042} teaches {item:15994} ({skill:202} 260) for 1g 20s. Sold by Alliance: {npc:5175} ({zone:1455}), limited stock; Horde: {npc:3413} ({zone:1454}), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; the Auction House often has it too."] = "{item:16042} 可教会制作 {item:15994}（{skill:202} 260），售价 1 金 20 银。出售者：联盟 {npc:5175}（{zone:1455}），限量；部落 {npc:3413}（{zone:1454}），限量。商人通常只备一两份，售出一段时间后补货；拍卖行也经常有售。",
		["{item:16047} teaches {item:16000} ({skill:202} 275) for 1g 60s. Sold by {npc:260565} ({zone:2548}) and {npc:11185} ({zone:1452}), limited stock."] = "{item:16047}用于学习{item:16000}（需要{skill:202}275），售价1金60银。出售者：{npc:260565}（{zone:2548}）和{npc:11185}（{zone:1452}），限量供应。",
		["{item:2319} (Alliance)"] = "{item:2319}（联盟）",
		["{item:2319} (Horde)"] = "{item:2319}（部落）",
		["{item:2836} (Alliance)"] = "{item:2836}（联盟）",
		["{item:2836} (Horde)"] = "{item:2836}（部落）",
		["{item:2838} (Alliance)"] = "{item:2838}（联盟）",
		["{item:2838} (Horde)"] = "{item:2838}（部落）",
		["{item:6533} is yellow at 150 (yellow 150, green 160, grey 170): about 31 crafts to 166. Each takes 2 {item:2841}, 1 {item:6530} and 1 {spell:3929} and makes 3. Make the 31 {spell:3929} first. {item:6530} come from trade and fishing suppliers; the attractors sell to fishermen. {item:2841} (100 for 150-225): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2840} and {item:3576}; or the Auction House."] = "{item:6533} 在技能150时为黄色（150变黄，160变绿，170变灰）：大约制作31次升到166。每次需要2块 {item:2841}、1个 {item:6530} 和1份 {spell:3929}，产出3个。先制作31份 {spell:3929}。{item:6530} 可向商贸或钓鱼供应商购买；制成的诱饵可卖给钓鱼玩家。{item:2841}（150—225共需100块）：{skill:186}：熔炼 {item:2840} 和 {item:3576}；或从拍卖行购买。",
		["{item:6533} to 166"] = "制作{item:6533}，提升至 166",
		["{item:6712} is orange at 100 (yellow 115, green 122, grey 130): about 31 crafts to 125. Each takes 1 {item:2841}, 2 {spell:3922} and 1 {item:2880}. Make the 29 {spell:3922} first. Use the 33 {spell:3922} you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. Practice Locks sell to rogues, or open them yourself. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:2841} (61 for 75-150): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2840} and {item:3576}; or the Auction House."] = "{item:6712} 在技能 100 时为橙色（115 变黄、122 变绿、130 变灰）：约制作 31 次可升到 125。每次需要 1 个 {item:2841}、2 个 {spell:3922} 和 1 个 {item:2880}。先制作 29 个 {spell:3922}。同时用上先前制作的 33 个 {spell:3922}；上方材料数量未将它们计入。练习锁可以卖给潜行者，也可以自己打开。附近需要有铁砧。{item:2841}（75-150 阶段需 61 个）：通过 {skill:186} 熔炼 {item:2840} 和 {item:3576}，或在拍卖行购买。",
		["{item:6712} to 125"] = "制作{item:6712}，提升至 125",
		["{item:7912} (Alliance)"] = "{item:7912}（联盟）",
		["{item:7912} (Horde)"] = "{item:7912}（部落）",
		["{skill:202} 1-75: vendor goods"] = "{skill:202} 1–75：商人材料",
		["{skill:202} 150-225: vendor goods"] = "{skill:202} 150–225：商人材料",
		["{skill:202} 75-150: vendor goods"] = "{skill:202} 75–150：商人材料",
		["{skill:202} recipes at 100"] = "100点的{skill:202}配方",
		["{skill:202} recipes at 125"] = "{skill:202} 125 级配方",
		["{skill:202} recipes at 140"] = "{skill:202}：技能 140 时学习的配方",
		["{skill:202} recipes at 175"] = "{skill:202} 175 级配方",
		["{skill:202} recipes at 191"] = "{skill:202}：技能 191 时学习的配方",
		["{skill:202} recipes at 210"] = "{skill:202} 210 级配方",
		["{skill:202} recipes at 245"] = "{skill:202} 245 级配方",
		["{skill:202} recipes at 35"] = "{skill:202}：技能 35 时学习的配方",
		["{skill:202} recipes at 57"] = "{skill:202}：技能 57 时学习的配方",
		["{spell:3918} is orange at 1 (yellow 20, green 30, grey 40): about 46 crafts to 35. Each takes 1 {item:2835}. One {item:2835} a craft; {item:2835} comes with the {item:2770} from Copper Veins."] = "{spell:3918}在1时为橙色（20变黄，30变绿，40变灰）：约制作46次可升至35。每次需要1个{item:2835}。每次一个{item:2835}；采铜矿获取{item:2770}时也会得到{item:2835}。",
		["{spell:3918} to 35"] = "制作{spell:3918}，提升至 35",
		["{spell:3922} is orange at 35 (yellow 45, green 52, grey 60): about 33 crafts to 57. Each takes 1 {item:2840}. One {item:2840} a craft. Keep the bolts: Practice Locks and later gadgets take them. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:5956} is a tool: keep it in your bags. {item:2840} (75 for 1-75): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2770}; or the Auction House."] = "{spell:3922}在技能35时为橙色（45变黄，52变绿，60变灰）：约制作33次可到57。每次需要1个{item:2840}。也就是每次1个{item:2840}。保留螺栓：练习锁及之后的装置会用到。附近需要有铁砧。{item:5956}是工具：保留在背包中。{item:2840}（1-75需75个）：通过{skill:186}熔炼{item:2770}，或从拍卖行购买。",
		["{spell:3922} to 57"] = "制作{spell:3922}，提升至 57",
		["{spell:3924} is orange at 57 (yellow 80, green 95, grey 110): about 18 crafts to 75, a point every craft. Each takes 2 {item:2840} and 1 {item:2880}. Two Copper Bars and a {item:2880} a craft (blacksmithing and engineering suppliers). Needs an anvil nearby. Make the {item:6219} now, while it still gives a point: a later recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there."] = "{spell:3924} 在技能 57 时为橙色（80 变黄、95 变绿、110 变灰）：约制作 18 次可升到 75，每次制作提升一点。每次需要 2 个 {item:2840} 和 1 个 {item:2880}，即两块铜锭和一个 {item:2880}（锻造和工程学供应商出售）。附近需要有铁砧。趁制作仍能提升技能，现在就制作 {item:6219}：后面的配方需要它在背包里，因此要一直保留。",
		["{spell:3924} is yellow at 94 (yellow 80, green 95, grey 110): about 14 crafts to 100. Each takes 2 {item:2840} and 1 {item:2880}. Two Copper Bars and a {item:2880} a craft (blacksmithing and engineering suppliers). Needs an anvil nearby."] = "{spell:3924} 在技能 94 时为黄色（80 变黄、95 变绿、110 变灰）：约制作 14 次可到 100。每次需要 2 个 {item:2840} 和 1 个 {item:2880}。即每次两块铜锭和一个 {item:2880}（由锻造和工程学供应商出售）。附近需要铁砧。",
		["{spell:3924} to 100"] = "{spell:3924}练到100",
		["{spell:3924} to 75"] = "{spell:3924}练到75",
		["{spell:3930} is orange at 75 (yellow 85, green 90, grey 95): about 15 crafts to 94. Each takes 1 {spell:3929} and 1 {item:2840} and makes 200. Make the 15 {spell:3929} first: it gives points too while not grey. The {spell:3929} in each gives its own point while it is not grey: two chances a craft. Sell the shot to hunters or a vendor. {item:2840} (72 for 75-150): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2770}; or the Auction House."] = "{spell:3930} 在技能75时为橙色（85变黄，90变绿，95变灰）：大约制作15次升到94。每次需要1份 {spell:3929} 和1块 {item:2840}，产出200发。先制作15份 {spell:3929}：只要尚未变灰，制作它也能涨点。每次所用的 {spell:3929} 在未变灰时也有自己的涨点机会：相当于每次有两次涨点机会。弹药可卖给猎人或商人。{item:2840}（75—150共需72块）：{skill:186}：熔炼 {item:2770}；或从拍卖行购买。",
		["{spell:3930} to 94"] = "制作{spell:3930}，提升至 94",
		["{spell:3945} is yellow at 125 (yellow 125, green 135, grey 145): about 27 crafts to 140. Each takes 1 {item:2838}. One {item:2838} a craft (Iron Deposits). Keep some: Iron Grenades take one each."] = "{spell:3945} 在技能 125 时为黄色（125 变黄、135 变绿、145 变灰）：约制作 27 次可到 140。每次需要 1 个 {item:2838}。即每次一个 {item:2838}（来自铁矿石）。留下一些：每颗铁皮手雷都要用一个。",
		["{spell:3945} to 140"] = "制作{spell:3945}，提升至 140",
		["{spell:3950} is yellow at 140 (yellow 140, green 165, grey 190): about 10 crafts to 150. Each takes 2 {item:4377}, 3 {item:2841} and 1 {spell:3973} and makes 3. Make the 10 {spell:3973} (2 crafts) first. Use the 20 {item:4377} you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. The trainer teaches it, and it is the cheapest way through these points in the data. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:2842} (2 for 75-150): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2775}; or the Auction House. {skill:202} 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:3950}在技能140时为黄色（140变黄，165变绿，190变灰）：约制作10次可到150。每次需要2个{item:4377}、3个{item:2841}和1个{spell:3973}，产出3个。先制作10个{spell:3973}（制作2次）。用之前做好的20个{item:4377}；上方统计未将其计入。此配方向训练师学习，是数据中度过这段技能点最便宜的方式。附近需要有铁砧。{item:2842}（75-150需2个）：通过{skill:186}熔炼{item:2775}，或从拍卖行购买。{skill:202}150是传承系统的一个里程碑。",
		["{spell:3950} to 150"] = "{spell:3950}练到150",
		["{spell:3953} is yellow at 166 (yellow 145, green 170, grey 195): about 19 crafts to 175. Each takes 2 {item:2841}, 1 {item:2319} and 1 {item:2592}. Bronze Frameworks are parts for later gadgets; the extras sell to vendors."] = "{spell:3953}在技能166时为黄色（145变黄，170变绿，195变灰）：约制作19次可到175。每次需要2个{item:2841}、1个{item:2319}和1个{item:2592}。青铜框架是之后装置的零件；多余的可卖给商人。",
		["{spell:3953} to 175"] = "将{spell:3953}做到 175",
		["{spell:3967} is yellow at 191 (yellow 190, green 210, grey 230): about 27 crafts to 210. Each takes 3 {item:3575}, 3 {spell:3945} and 1 {spell:3973} and makes 2. Make the 74 {spell:3945} and 30 {spell:3973} (6 crafts) first. Use the 7 {spell:3945} you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. A {item:2842} makes five Silver Contacts (grey by now: no points, but no trip to a vendor either); the {spell:3945} comes from {item:2838}. Each craft makes two bombs. Specialisation (optional): at 200 and character level 30, {npc:5174} ({zone:1455}), {npc:5518} ({zone:1453}), {npc:4586} ({zone:1458}) or Tinkerwiz ({area:392}) sends you to {spell:20220} ({npc:7944}, {zone:1455}, or {npc:7406}, {area:35}: 6 Mithril Tubes, an {item:4407} and 2 Advanced Target Dummies) or Goblin Engineering ({npc:8126}, {area:976}: 20 Big Iron Bombs, 20 {item:10507} and 5 {npc:2675}). The {item:4407} schematic now binds when picked up, but the quest takes a scope someone else made. The membership card lasts 14 days of play; renewing it costs 2g. You can take only one; neither is needed for 300, and the beta never tested them (it stopped at level 30). Needs an anvil nearby. {item:2842} (6 for 150-225): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2775}; or the Auction House. {item:3575} (81 for 150-225): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2772}; or the Auction House."] = "{spell:3967} 在技能 191 时为黄色（190 变黄，210 变绿，230 变灰）：约制作 27 次可到 210。每次需要 3 个 {item:3575}、3 个 {spell:3945} 和 1 个 {spell:3973}，产出 2 个。先制作 74 个 {spell:3945} 和 30 个 {spell:3973}（制作 6 次）。用上之前做好的 7 个 {spell:3945}；上述数量未将它们计入。一个 {item:2842} 可制成五个银触媒（此时已变灰，不再加技能点，但也无需再跑商人）；{spell:3945} 用 {item:2838} 制作。每次制作产出两个炸弹。专精（可选）：技能达到 200 且角色等级 30 时，{npc:5174}（{zone:1455}）、{npc:5518}（{zone:1453}）、{npc:4586}（{zone:1458}）或廷克维斯（{area:392}）会指引你学习 {spell:20220}（找 {zone:1455} 的 {npc:7944}，或 {area:35} 的 {npc:7406}：需要 6 个秘银管、一个 {item:4407} 和 2 个高级假人）或地精工程学（找 {area:976} 的 {npc:8126}：需要 20 个大铁炸弹、20 个 {item:10507} 和 5 个 {npc:2675}）。{item:4407} 的设计图现为拾取后绑定，但任务接受他人制作的瞄准镜。会员卡有效期为 14 天游戏时间，续期需 2 金币。只能选择一种专精；冲到 300 都不需要它们，而且测试版从未测试过这两种专精（测试止于 30 级）。附近需要有铁砧。{item:2842}（150-225 阶段需 6 个）：通过 {skill:186} 熔炼 {item:2775}，或从拍卖行购买。{item:3575}（150-225 阶段需 81 个）：通过 {skill:186} 熔炼 {item:2772}，或从拍卖行购买。",
		["{spell:3967} to 210"] = "制作{spell:3967}，提升至 210",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/professions/first-aid"] = (function() return {
		["Any {skill:129} trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice {skill:129} (any character level, 1s); the arrow picks the nearest. Forever teaches {item:118} with it: {item:2447}, {item:2678} and an {item:3371}, orange to 55. With {skill:182} it can replace the Linen Bandages below."] = "你所在阵营的任何{skill:129}训练师都教授初级{skill:129}（无角色等级要求，1银）；箭头会指向最近的一位。无限会同时教授{item:118}：{item:2447}、{item:2678}和一个{item:3371}，55前为橙色。有{skill:182}的话，它可以替代下面的亚麻绷带。",
		["Artisan {skill:129}"] = "专家级{skill:129}",
		["Artisan {skill:129} comes from the {quest:6622} quest. It needs skill 225 and level 35; the {skill:129} trainer in {zone:1454} sends you to the doctor in {area:321}. Bring the Mageweave (about 74) and {item:14047} (about 65) for 225-300 now: bandages need no fire, so you craft 225-300 beside the doctor, who teaches the Artisan bandages."] = "专家级{skill:129}来自{quest:6622}任务。需要技能225和等级35；{zone:1454}的{skill:129}训练师会派你去{area:321}找医生。现在就带上225-300所需的魔纹布（约74）和{item:14047}（约65）：绷带不需要火，所以你可以在教授专家级绷带的医生旁边练到300。",
		["Artisan {skill:129} comes from the {quest:6624} quest. It needs skill 225 and level 35; the {skill:129} trainer in {zone:1455} sends you to the doctor in Theramore. Bring the Mageweave (about 74) and {item:14047} (about 65) for 225-300 now: bandages need no fire, so you craft 225-300 beside the doctor, who teaches the Artisan bandages."] = "专家级{skill:129}来自{quest:6624}任务。需要技能225和等级35；{zone:1455}的{skill:129}训练师会派你去塞拉摩找医生。现在就带上225-300所需的魔纹布（约74）和{item:14047}（约65）：绷带不需要火，所以你可以在教授专家级绷带的医生旁边练到300。",
		["Buy and read {item:16084} (Expert {skill:129})"] = "购买并阅读{item:16084}（高级{skill:129}）",
		["Expert {skill:129}"] = "高级{skill:129}",
		["Expert {skill:129} raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and character level 20: it is a book, {item:16084} (1g); the arrow picks its nearest seller for your faction. Buy it and read it. The same vendor sells the Heavy Silk and {item:8544} manuals (22s and 50s): buy both now, you read them at 180 and 210."] = "高级{skill:129}将上限提高到225；需要技能125和角色等级20：这是一本书，{item:16084}（1金）；箭头会指向你所在阵营最近的卖家。购买并阅读。同一商人还出售厚丝绸和{item:8544}的手册（22银和50银）：现在两本都买下，在180和210时阅读。",
		["Journeyman {skill:129}"] = "中级{skill:129}",
		["Journeyman {skill:129} raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and no character level: the arrow picks the nearest {skill:129} trainer of your faction; training costs 5s."] = "中级{skill:129}将上限提高到150；需要技能50，没有角色等级要求：箭头会指向你所在阵营最近的{skill:129}训练师；训练花费5银。",
		["Learn {skill:129}"] = "学习{skill:129}",
		["Trauma"] = "创伤",
		["{item:1251} is orange from 1 (yellow at 30, green at 45, grey at 60): about 41 crafts to 40. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. At 20 the trainer also teaches {item:279968} (1s; the Camping 101: {skill:129} quest at your starting area's camp teaches it free), Forever's camping item for {skill:129}: three Linen Bandages and a {item:159}; it gives a few points until 25."] = "{item:1251}从1开始为橙色（30变黄，45变绿，60变灰）：约制作41次到40。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。20时训练师还会教授{item:279968}（1银；起始区域营地的“野营入门101：{skill:129}”任务可免费学会），这是无限的{skill:129}野营物品：三条亚麻绷带和一瓶{item:159}；25前能提供少量点数。",
		["{item:1251}: cloth"] = "{item:1251}：布料",
		["{item:14047} drops from humanoids of level 45-60: keep what you loot as you level, take it from your bank, or buy it at the Auction House."] = "{item:14047}由45-60级的人型生物掉落：升级时把拾取到的留着，从银行取出，或在拍卖行购买。",
		["{item:14529} is yellow from 260 (yellow at 260, green at 290, grey at 320): about 65 crafts to 300. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. {item:14529} turns green at 290, yet to 300 it takes about the same {item:14047} as switching to {item:14530} (the doctor teaches it at 290): one recipe is enough."] = "{item:14529}从260开始为黄色（260变黄，290变绿，320变灰）：约制作65次到300。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。{item:14529}在290变绿，但到300所需的{item:14047}与改做{item:14530}（医生在290时教授）差不多：一个配方就够了。",
		["{item:14529}: cloth"] = "{item:14529}：布料",
		["{item:2581} is orange from 40 (yellow at 50, green at 75, grey at 100): about 10 crafts to 50. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Any {skill:129} trainer of your faction teaches it from skill 40 for 1s; the arrow picks the nearest."] = "{item:2581}从40开始为橙色（50变黄，75变绿，100变灰）：约制作10次到50。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。你所在阵营的任何{skill:129}训练师在技能40时教授，花费1银；箭头会指向最近的一位。",
		["{item:2581} is yellow from 50 (yellow at 50, green at 75, grey at 100): about 46 crafts to 80. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Herbalists: {item:858} (from 55, 1s 50c; {item:2450}, two {item:2678} and an {item:3371}) is orange to 85."] = "{item:2581}从50开始为黄色（50变黄，75变绿，100变灰）：约制作46次到80。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。草药师：{item:858}（55起，1银50铜；{item:2450}、两份{item:2678}和一个{item:3371}）在85前为橙色。",
		["{item:2581}: cloth"] = "{item:2581}：布料",
		["{item:2589} drops from humanoids of level 5-20: keep what you loot as you level, take it from your bank, or buy it at the Auction House."] = "{item:2589}由5-20级的人型生物掉落：升级时把拾取到的留着，从银行取出，或在拍卖行购买。",
		["{item:2592} drops from humanoids of level 15-30: keep what you loot as you level, take it from your bank, or buy it at the Auction House."] = "{item:2592}由15-30级的人型生物掉落：升级时把拾取到的留着，从银行取出，或在拍卖行购买。",
		["{item:4306} drops from humanoids of level 25-45: keep what you loot as you level, take it from your bank, or buy it at the Auction House."] = "{item:4306}由25-45级的人型生物掉落：升级时把拾取到的留着，从银行取出，或在拍卖行购买。",
		["{item:4338} drops from humanoids of level 35-50: keep what you loot as you level, take it from your bank, or buy it at the Auction House."] = "{item:4338}由35-50级的人型生物掉落：升级时把拾取到的留着，从银行取出，或在拍卖行购买。",
		["{item:6450} is yellow from 150 (yellow at 150, green at 180, grey at 210): about 42 crafts to 180. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Any {skill:129} trainer of your faction teaches it from skill 150 for 50s; the arrow picks the nearest."] = "{item:6450}从150开始为黄色（150变黄，180变绿，210变灰）：约制作42次到180。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。你所在阵营的任何{skill:129}训练师在技能150时教授，花费50银；箭头会指向最近的一位。",
		["{item:6450}: cloth"] = "{item:6450}：布料",
		["{item:6451} is yellow from 180 (yellow at 180, green at 210, grey at 240): about 42 crafts to 210. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "{item:6451}从180开始为黄色（180变黄，210变绿，240变灰）：约制作42次到210。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。",
		["{item:6451}: cloth"] = "{item:6451}：布料",
		["{item:8544} is yellow from 210 (yellow at 210, green at 240, grey at 270): about 18 crafts to 225. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "{item:8544}从210开始为黄色（210变黄，240变绿，270变灰）：约制作18次到225。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。",
		["{item:8544} is yellow from 225 (yellow at 210, green at 240, grey at 270): about 24 crafts to 240. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. {item:8544} turns green at 240: switch to Heavy Mageweave there, which costs less cloth than green Mageweave Bandages to 260."] = "{item:8544}从225开始为黄色（210变黄，240变绿，270变灰）：约制作24次到240。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。{item:8544}在240变绿：届时改做厚魔纹绷带，到260比做绿色的魔纹绷带更省布。",
		["{item:8544}: cloth"] = "{item:8544}：布料",
		["{item:8545} is yellow from 240 (yellow at 240, green at 270, grey at 300): about 25 crafts to 260. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "{item:8545}从240开始为黄色（240变黄，270变绿，300变灰）：约制作25次到260。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。",
		["{item:8545}: cloth"] = "{item:8545}：布料",
		["{quest:6622}: the doctor hands you Triage Bandages; use those, not your own. Fifteen wounded soldiers lie on the floor inside: bandage the critically injured first, then the badly injured, then the injured, before any die (show the health bars with Ctrl+V). Turn the quest in the moment fifteen are saved: the others keep dying, and too many deaths fail it even after it reads complete. If it fails, abandon it and take it again."] = "{quest:6622}：医生会给你急救绷带；用这些，不要用你自己的。里面地上躺着十五名伤兵：在他们死亡前，先包扎危重伤员，再包扎重伤员，最后是伤员（按Ctrl+V显示生命条）。救满十五人后立即交还任务：其他人会继续死亡，死亡过多即使显示已完成也会失败。如果失败，放弃任务并重新接受。",
		["{quest:6624}: the doctor hands you Triage Bandages; use those, not your own. Fifteen wounded soldiers lie inside: bandage the critically injured first, then the badly injured, then the injured, before any die (show the health bars with Ctrl+V). Turn the quest in the moment fifteen are saved: the others keep dying, and too many deaths fail it even after it reads complete. If it fails, abandon it and take it again."] = "{quest:6624}：医生会给你急救绷带；用这些，不要用你自己的。里面躺着十五名伤兵：在他们死亡前，先包扎危重伤员，再包扎重伤员，最后是伤员（按Ctrl+V显示生命条）。救满十五人后立即交还任务：其他人会继续死亡，死亡过多即使显示已完成也会失败。如果失败，放弃任务并重新接受。",
		["{spell:10841} (skill 240) is an Artisan recipe: only the {quest:6622} doctor teaches it ({npc:12939} in Theramore, {npc:12920} in {area:321})."] = "{spell:10841}（技能240）是专家级配方：只有{quest:6622}的医生会教（塞拉摩的{npc:12939}，{area:321}的{npc:12920}）。",
		["{spell:18629} (skill 260) is an Artisan recipe: only the {quest:6622} doctor teaches it ({npc:12939} in Theramore, {npc:12920} in {area:321})."] = "{spell:18629}（技能260）是专家级配方：只有{quest:6622}的医生会教（塞拉摩的{npc:12939}，{area:321}的{npc:12920}）。",
		["{spell:3277} is yellow from 80 (yellow at 80, green at 115, grey at 150): about 49 crafts to 115. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Any {skill:129} trainer of your faction teaches it from skill 80 for 2s 50c; the arrow picks the nearest. {item:6452} ({item:1475}, from spiders) is taught at 80 too: Rogues need it for {spell:9810}, and it sells."] = "{spell:3277}从80开始为黄色（80变黄，115变绿，150变灰）：约制作49次到115。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。你所在阵营的任何{skill:129}训练师在技能80时教授，花费2银50铜；箭头会指向最近的一位。{item:6452}（{item:1475}，蜘蛛掉落）也在80时教授：盗贼的{spell:9810}需要它，也能卖钱。",
		["{spell:3277}: cloth"] = "{spell:3277}：布料",
		["{spell:3278} is yellow from 115 (yellow at 115, green at 150, grey at 185): about 11 crafts to 125. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Any {skill:129} trainer of your faction teaches it from skill 115 for 10s; the arrow picks the nearest. Herbalists: {item:929} (from 110, 8s; {item:2453}, {item:2692} and a {item:3372}) is orange to 135."] = "{spell:3278}从115开始为黄色（115变黄，150变绿，185变灰）：约制作11次到125。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。你所在阵营的任何{skill:129}训练师在技能115时教授，花费10银；箭头会指向最近的一位。草药师：{item:929}（110起，8银；{item:2453}、{item:2692}和一个{item:3372}）在135前为橙色。",
		["{spell:3278} is yellow from 125 (yellow at 115, green at 150, grey at 185): about 38 crafts to 150. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "{spell:3278}从125开始为黄色（115变黄，150变绿，185变灰）：约制作38次到150。绷带不需要火：随处都能制作。",
		["{spell:3278}: cloth"] = "{spell:3278}：布料",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/professions/fishing"] = (function() return {
		["Any {skill:356} trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice {skill:356} at any character level (1s); the arrow picks the nearest, and every starting area has one on its lake or shore. Buy a {item:6256} (23c) from a trade goods or fishing vendor and equip it (you can only fish with a pole in your hands), and two or three Shiny Baubles (+25, 50c each): a lure adds its bonus to your skill for ten minutes, so fewer fish get away at the start. If you sat at your starting area's campfire for The Great Outdoors, the camping guide there also offers Camping 101: {skill:356}, handed in to the fishing trainer it names at skill 20 for the {spell:1229745} recipe."] = "本阵营的任意{skill:356}训练师都教授初级{skill:356}，没有角色等级要求（1银）；箭头会选择最近的一位，每个初始地区的湖边或海岸都有训练师。向杂货商或钓鱼供应商购买一根{item:6256}（23铜）并装备（只有手持鱼竿才能钓鱼），再买两三个闪光的小珠（+25，每个50铜）：鱼饵可为技能提供持续十分钟的加成，减少刚开始钓鱼时的逃脱。如果你为“广阔天地”在初始地区的营火旁坐过，那里负责露营指引的NPC还会提供“露营基础：{skill:356}”任务；技能达到20时，向任务指定的钓鱼训练师交还，可获得{spell:1229745}配方。",
		["Artisan {skill:356}"] = "专家级{skill:356}",
		["Artisan {skill:356} (cap 300) comes from {npc:12919} in {zone:1445}. The fishing trainer in {zone:1454} sends you to him; the quest needs skill 225 and level 35."] = "专家级{skill:356}（上限300）由{zone:1445}的{npc:12919}传授。{zone:1454}的钓鱼训练师会让你去找他；任务需要技能225和35级。",
		["Artisan {skill:356} (cap 300) comes from {npc:12919} in {zone:1445}. The fishing trainer in {zone:1455} sends you to him; the quest needs skill 225 and level 35."] = "专家级{skill:356}（上限300）由{zone:1445}的{npc:12919}传授。{zone:1455}的钓鱼训练师会让你去找他；任务需要技能225和35级。",
		["Buy and read {item:16083} (Expert {skill:356})"] = "购买并阅读{item:16083}（高级{skill:356}）",
		["Expert {skill:356}"] = "高级{skill:356}",
		["Expert {skill:356} (cap 225) is a book, not a trainer rank: {npc:2626} sells {item:16083} (1g) on the lowest dock of {area:35}, at the south tip of {zone:1434}, to both factions. Buy it and read it; it needs skill 125 and level 20. At level 20 the safe way in is the boat from {area:392} in {zone:1413}, not the road through Stranglethorn. He also sells {item:6532} (+75 from skill 100, 2s 50c each), the lure for the rest of the way."] = "高级 {skill:356}（上限225）需要读书学习，不是训练师教授的等级：{npc:2626} 在 {zone:1434} 南端 {area:35} 最下层的码头出售 {item:16083}（1金币），双方阵营都能购买。买来阅读；需要技能125和角色20级。20级时，安全的前往方式是从 {zone:1413} 的 {area:392} 坐船，别沿路穿越荆棘谷。他还出售 {item:6532}（技能100起可用，+75，每个2银币50铜币），后续阶段可用它作鱼饵。",
		["Fish along the coast of {zone:1443} ({area:598} in the north-west, or the shore west of {area:2408}) until you catch a {item:16968}: about one catch in five there brings it up, and it bites nowhere else. At skill 225 nothing gets away here."] = "沿 {zone:1443} 海岸钓鱼（西北面的 {area:598}，或 {area:2408} 西面的海岸），直到钓到 {item:16968}：那里每次上钩约有五分之一概率是它，其他地方钓不到。技能225时，这里不会有鱼逃脱。",
		["Fish along the {area:2521} in {zone:1444} (south-east of {area:2577}) until you catch a {item:16967}: about one catch in five there brings it up, and it bites nowhere else. This water loses fish below skill 300: at 225 most get away, so put {item:6532} (+75) on the pole first."] = "在 {zone:1444} 的 {area:2521} 沿岸垂钓（{area:2577} 东南方），直到钓到一条 {item:16967}：那里约每五次收获有一次能钓到，其他水域都钓不到。技能低于300时，这片水域的鱼会逃脱：225点时大多数都会跑掉，因此先给鱼竿装上 {item:6532}（+75）。",
		["Fish along the {area:300} (the east shore of {zone:1435}) until you catch a {item:16970}: about one catch in five there brings it up, and it bites nowhere else. At skill 225 nothing gets away here."] = "沿{area:300}（{zone:1435}东海岸）钓鱼，直到钓起一个{item:16970}：在这里约每五次能钓起一个，其他地方则钓不到。技能225时，这里的鱼都不会逃脱。",
		["Fish along {zone:1434}'s {area:301} (the west shore) until you catch a {item:16969}: about one catch in five there brings it up, and it bites nowhere else. At skill 225 nothing gets away here."] = "沿 {zone:1434} 的 {area:301}（西海岸）钓鱼，直到钓到 {item:16969}：那里每次上钩约有五分之一概率是它，其他地方钓不到。技能225时，这里不会有鱼逃脱。",
		["Fish here until skill 50, about 50 catches: below 75 every catch raises the skill. Cast {skill:356} from your spellbook, click the bobber when it splashes. Keep the fish: they are your first {skill:185} ingredients."] = "在这里钓到技能50，大约需钓起50条鱼：75以前每次钓起鱼都会提升技能。从法术书施放{skill:356}，鱼漂溅起水花时点击。把鱼留着：它们是你最初的{skill:185}材料。",
		["Fish here until skill 50, about 50 catches: below 75 every catch raises the skill. Cast {skill:356} from your spellbook, click the bobber when it splashes. Keep the fish: they are your first {skill:185} ingredients. Fish get away here below skill 25; a lure on the pole adds to your skill for ten minutes and closes the gap."] = "在这里钓到技能 50，约需钓起 50 条：75 以下每次成功钓起都会涨技能。从法术书施放 {skill:356}，浮漂溅水时点击。鱼留着：它们是你最初的 {skill:185} 材料。技能低于 25 时，这里的鱼会逃脱；给鱼竿装上鱼饵可以提高技能，持续十分钟，弥补差距。",
		["Fish the pools along the coast here (eels, snappers, wreckage) until skill 300, about 650 catches (one in seven raises the skill at 225, one in ten by 300). Harder water levels no faster: a catch counts the same anywhere. From skill 225 this water loses no fish, so no lure is needed. The {item:6533} (+100 from skill 100, 2s 50c) and {item:6532} are for harder water and rare fish, not for skill."] = "在此处沿海的鱼群和残骸处垂钓（鳗鱼、钳嘴鱼、残骸），直到技能300，约需650次收获（225点时约每七次提升一点，到300时约每十次提升一点）。难度更高的水域不会让技能提升更快：无论在哪里，每次成功垂钓的作用相同。技能225起，在这片水域的鱼就不会逃脱，因此无需鱼饵。{item:6533}（技能100起可用，+100，2银币50铜币）和 {item:6532} 用于更难的水域和稀有鱼，而非提升技能。",
		["Fish the pools and open water here until skill 125, about 120 catches: from 75 a catch raises the skill less often (about one in two by 100, one in three by 125). Pools (floating wreckage, schools of fish) also give extra loot. {item:6530} (+50 from skill 50, 1s each) are twice as strong as a {item:6529}. The {item:6365} (+5 from skill 10, 9s 1c) is in limited stock at fishing vendors: buy it when you see it. Fish get away here below skill 75; a lure on the pole adds to your skill for ten minutes and closes the gap."] = "在这里的鱼群和普通水域钓到技能 125，约需钓起 120 次：75 起，每次钓起涨技能的概率会下降（100 时约二分之一，125 时约三分之一）。鱼群或漂浮残骸等水面钓鱼点还会产出额外战利品。{item:6530}（技能 50 起可用，+50，每个 1 银币）的加成是 {item:6529} 的两倍。{item:6365}（技能 10 起可用，+5，9 银 1 铜）在钓鱼商人处限量出售：看到就买。技能低于 75 时，这里的鱼会逃脱；给鱼竿装上鱼饵可以提高技能，持续十分钟，弥补差距。",
		["Fish the pools here until skill 225, about 500 catches: one in three raises the skill at 125, one in seven by 225, so this is the long stretch. Forever's second camping item, the {item:279965} (from skill 140), is a blueprint that drops from Gelihast in {area:2797}. Fish get away here below skill 150; a lure on the pole adds to your skill for ten minutes and closes the gap."] = "在这里的水池钓到技能225，约需钓上500条鱼：技能125时每3次约涨一点，到225时每7次才涨一点，所以这一段较长。无限的第二种露营物品{item:279965}（需要技能140）来自{area:2797}的格里哈斯特掉落的蓝图。技能低于150时，这里的鱼会逃脱；给鱼竿装上鱼饵可提高技能10分钟，补足差距。",
		["Journeyman {skill:356}"] = "中级{skill:356}",
		["Journeyman {skill:356} raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and character level 10 (Forever's sniffed trainer lists ask for that level), and costs 5s. The arrow picks the nearest {skill:356} trainer of your faction. {spell:1229745}, Forever's camping item for {skill:356} (from skill 20, 1s or free from Camping 101: {skill:356}), is a {item:6291} in an {item:3371}: it gives no skill, but placed beside a campfire it gives everyone at the camp a buff for an hour."] = "中级{skill:356}将技能上限提高到150；需要技能50和角色10级（无限抓取到的训练师列表要求该等级），费用5银币。箭头指向本阵营最近的{skill:356}训练师。{spell:1229745}是无限的{skill:356}露营物品（需要技能20，1银币，也可通过“露营 101: {skill:356}”免费获得），就是把{item:6291}装在{item:3371}中：制作不涨技能，但放在营火旁后，营地里的所有人都能获得持续1小时的增益。",
		["Learn {skill:356}"] = "学习{skill:356}",
		["Sen'jin coast"] = "森金海岸",
		["{area:16638} shore"] = "{area:16638}湖岸",
		["{area:287} coast"] = "{area:287}海岸",
		["{area:35} coast"] = "{area:35}海岸",
		["{npc:12919} fishes from the shore of a small island off the east coast, south of Theramore; swim over from the coast."] = "{npc:12919}在东海岸外、塞拉摩南面的一座小岛岸边钓鱼；从海岸游过去。",
		["{zone:1413} oasis"] = "{zone:1413}绿洲",
		["{zone:1436} coast"] = "{zone:1436}海岸",
		["{zone:1437} coast"] = "{zone:1437}海岸",
		["{zone:1439} coast"] = "{zone:1439}海岸",
		["{zone:1440} waters"] = "{zone:1440}水域",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/professions/herbalism"] = (function() return {
		["Any {skill:182} trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice {skill:182} at any level (10c), and so does the Junior Herbalism Trainer in each starting area; the arrow picks the nearest. Turn on {spell:2383} (spellbook, General tab) so herbs show on the minimap. Forever's starting areas also have {object:656160} and {object:656161} (skill 1). The first-hour quest of each starting area (Rascally Rodents, Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery, The Woodland Protector, Galgar's {item:11584}, A Humble Task, Marla's Last Wish) offers {item:247841} as a reward: reading it gives 2 skill, up to 15. Trade goods vendors sell the {item:277113}, a four-slot bag for herbs (25c). If you sat at your starting area's campfire for The Great Outdoors, the camping guide there also offers Camping 101: {skill:182}: hand it in to the herbalism trainer it names once you reach skill 20, for the {spell:1229705} recipe."] = "本阵营的任意 {skill:182} 训练师都能在任何角色等级教授初级 {skill:182}（10铜币），各起始地区的初级草药学训练师也一样；箭头会选择最近的一位。开启 {spell:2383}（法术书的综合分页），让草药显示在微缩地图上。无限服起始地区还有 {object:656160} 和 {object:656161}（技能1）。各起始地区最初一小时内的任务（鼠辈泛滥、寒脊山谷的送信任务、森林守护者、高尔加的 {item:11584}、一件琐事、玛拉的遗愿）会提供奖励 {item:247841}：阅读后增加2点技能，最高可到15。杂货商出售 {item:277113}，这是四格草药包（25铜币）。如果你曾为“广阔天地”坐在起始地区的营火旁，那里的露营向导还会提供露营 101：{skill:182}：技能达到20后，将其交还给任务指定的草药学训练师，获得 {spell:1229705} 配方。",
		["Artisan {skill:182}"] = "专家级{skill:182}",
		["Artisan {skill:182} raises the cap to 300; it needs skill 200 and no character level, and costs 5g: train it as soon as you reach 200. The arrow picks the nearest {skill:182} trainer of your faction."] = "大师级 {skill:182} 将上限提高到300；需要技能200，无角色等级要求，费用5金币：达到200就立即学习。箭头会选择本阵营最近的 {skill:182} 训练师。",
		["Expert {skill:182}"] = "高级{skill:182}",
		["Expert {skill:182} raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and no character level, and costs 50s: train it as soon as you reach 125. The arrow picks the nearest {skill:182} trainer of your faction."] = "高级{skill:182}将技能上限提高到225；需要技能125，无角色等级要求，费用50银币：达到125后立刻学习。箭头指向本阵营最近的{skill:182}训练师。",
		["Journeyman {skill:182}"] = "中级{skill:182}",
		["Journeyman {skill:182} raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and no character level, and costs 5s: train it as soon as you reach 50. The arrow picks the nearest {skill:182} trainer of your faction. {spell:1229705}, Forever's camping item for {skill:182}, is taught from skill 20 (1s, or free from Camping 101: {skill:182}): a {item:2447} and a {item:765} each, it gives points until 25; placed beside a campfire it gives everyone at the camp a buff for an hour."] = "中级 {skill:182} 将上限提高到 150；要求技能 50，无角色等级要求，费用 5 银币：一到 50 就去学。箭头会选择本阵营最近的 {skill:182} 训练师。无限的 {skill:182} 露营物品 {spell:1229705} 在技能 20 起可学（1 银币，或通过露营 101: {skill:182} 免费学习）：每次需要一个 {item:2447} 和一个 {item:765}，制作可涨技能至 25；放在营火旁，会给予营地内所有人持续一小时的增益。",
		["Learn {skill:182}"] = "学习{skill:182}",
		["Pick every {item:2447} (1, orange), {item:765} (1, orange), {item:2449} (from 15) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 50. Zone level 1-15. Expect about 60 herbs for these 49 points."] = "采集沿途每一株 {item:2447}（1，橙色）、{item:765}（1，橙色）、{item:2449}（15起可采），沿路径点循环，直到 {skill:182} 达到50。地区等级1—15。提升这49点预计需采集约60株草药。",
		["Pick every {item:2447} (1, orange), {item:765} (1, orange), {object:656161} (1, orange), {object:656160} (1, orange), {item:2449} (from 15) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 50. Zone level 1-10. Expect about 60 herbs for these 49 points."] = "沿途遇到的 {item:2447}（1，橙色）、{item:765}（1，橙色）、{object:656161}（1，橙色）、{object:656160}（1，橙色）和 {item:2449}（15 起）都采，沿路径点循环，直到 {skill:182} 50。地区等级 1-10。提升这 49 点预计需要采约 60 株草药。",
		["Pick every {item:2447} (1, orange), {item:765} (1, orange), {object:656161} (1, orange, rare), {object:656160} (1, orange), {item:2449} (from 15) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 50. Zone level 1-10. Expect about 60 herbs for these 49 points."] = "采集沿途每一株 {item:2447}（1，橙色）、{item:765}（1，橙色）、{object:656161}（1，橙色，稀有）、{object:656160}（1，橙色）、{item:2449}（15起可采），沿路径点循环，直到 {skill:182} 达到50。地区等级1—10。提升这49点预计需采集约60株草药。",
		["Pick every {item:2447} (1, orange), {item:765} (1, orange), {object:656161} (1, orange, rare), {object:656160} (1, orange, rare), {item:2449} (from 15) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 50. Zone level 1-10. Expect about 60 herbs for these 49 points."] = "采集沿途所有 {item:2447}（技能 1，橙色）、{item:765}（技能 1，橙色）、矮小的银叶草（技能 1，橙色，稀有）、枯萎的宁神花（技能 1，橙色，稀有）、{item:2449}（技能 15 起），沿路径点循环采集，直到 {skill:182} 达到 50。地区等级为 1-10 级。提升这 49 点预计需要采集约 60 株草药。",
		["Pick every {item:2447} (1, yellow), {item:765} (1, yellow), {item:2449} (15, yellow), {item:785} (50, orange), {item:2450} (from 70) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 100. {item:785} and {item:2450} sometimes give a {item:2452} as well. Zone level 10-20. Expect about 140 herbs for these 50 points."] = "采集沿途每一株 {item:2447}（1，黄色）、{item:765}（1，黄色）、{item:2449}（15，黄色）、{item:785}（50，橙色）、{item:2450}（70起），沿路径点循环采集，直到 {skill:182} 100。{item:785} 和 {item:2450} 有时还会附带 {item:2452}。地区等级10—20。提升这50点预计需要采集约140株草药。",
		["Pick every {item:2447} (1, yellow), {item:765} (1, yellow), {item:2449} (15, yellow), {item:785} (50, orange), {item:2450} (from 70), {item:3820} (from 85) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 100. {item:785} and {item:2450} sometimes give a {item:2452} as well. {item:3820} grows underwater along the shore: watch your breath. A quest here needs {skill:182}: Root Samples (level 16, {npc:3446}). Zone level 10-25. Expect about 110 herbs for these 50 points."] = "沿途遇到的 {item:2447}（1，黄色）、{item:765}（1，黄色）、{item:2449}（15，黄色）、{item:785}（50，橙色）、{item:2450}（70 起）和 {item:3820}（85 起）都采，沿路径点循环，直到 {skill:182} 100。采集 {item:785} 和 {item:2450} 有时还会获得 {item:2452}。{item:3820} 生长在沿岸水下：注意呼吸。这里有个任务要求 {skill:182}：根须样本（16 级，{npc:3446}）。地区等级 10-25。提升这 50 点预计需要采约 110 株草药。",
		["Pick every {item:2447} (1, yellow), {item:765} (1, yellow), {item:2449} (15, yellow), {item:785} (50, orange), {item:2450} (from 70), {item:3820} (from 85) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 100. {item:785} and {item:2450} sometimes give a {item:2452} as well. {item:3820} grows underwater along the shore: watch your breath. Zone level 10-20. Expect about 130 herbs for these 50 points."] = "采集沿途所有{item:2447}（1，黄色）、{item:765}（1，黄色）、{item:2449}（15，黄色）、{item:785}（50，橙色）、{item:2450}（70起）和{item:3820}（85起），沿路径点循环，直到{skill:182}100。采集{item:785}和{item:2450}时，有时还会获得{item:2452}。{item:3820}长在岸边水下：注意呼吸时间。地区等级10-20。这50点预计需采约130株草药。",
		["Pick every {item:2447} (1, yellow), {item:765} (1, yellow), {item:2449} (15, yellow), {item:785} (50, orange), {item:2450} (from 70), {item:3820} (from 85) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 100. {item:785} and {item:2450} sometimes give a {item:2452} as well. {item:3820} grows underwater along the shore: watch your breath. Zone level 10-20. Expect about 140 herbs for these 50 points."] = "采集沿途每一株 {item:2447}（1，黄色）、{item:765}（1，黄色）、{item:2449}（15，黄色）、{item:785}（50，橙色）、{item:2450}（70起可采）、{item:3820}（85起可采），沿路径点循环，直到 {skill:182} 达到100。采集 {item:785} 和 {item:2450} 时有时还会获得一株 {item:2452}。{item:3820} 长在岸边水下：留意呼吸。地区等级10—20。提升这50点预计需采集约140株草药。",
